<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marko Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Asɛmpa a ɛfa Yesu Kristo, Onyankopɔn Ba no ho no, ahyɛaseɛ nie. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Wɔatwerɛ wɔ Odiyifoɔ Yesaia nwoma no mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mɛsoma me ɔbɔfoɔ adi wʼanim ɛkan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Ɔno na ɔbɛsiesie ɛkwan ama wo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>“Nne bi reteam firi ɛserɛ so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Monsiesie ɛkwan mma Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">mommɔ akwan a ɛtene mma no.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Enti Yohane ba bɛbɔɔ asu wɔ ɛserɛ so, ɔkaa adwensakyera asubɔ a ɛma bɔnefakyɛ ho asɛm. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Nnipa fifiri Yerusalem ne Yudea nkuro so kɔhunuu Yohane, tiee no. Na wɔkaa wɔn bɔne kyerɛɛ no no, ɔbɔɔ wɔn asu wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan mu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Na Yohane hyɛ atadeɛ a wɔde yoma nhoma na apam a aboa nhoma abɔsoɔ nso bɔ mu. Na nʼaduane yɛ ntutummɛ ne ɛwoɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no mu, ɔkaa sɛ, “Ɛrenkyɛre koraa, obi bɛba a ɔwɔ tumi sene me a, ne mpaboa ahoma mpo, mensɛ sɛ mekoto mesane. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Me deɛ, mede nsuo na ɛbɔ mo asu, na ɔno deɛ, ɔde Honhom Kronkron na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asubɔ Ne Ne Sɔhwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Ɛda bi, Yesu firii Nasaret a ɛwɔ Galileaman mu ba maa Yohane bɔɔ no asu wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan mu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yesu firi nsuo no mu sii konkɔn so ara pɛ, ɔhunuu sɛ ɔsoro abue, na Honhom Kronkron resiane sɛ aborɔnoma aba ne so. Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>ɛnne bi firi ɔsoro kaa sɛ, “Wone me Dɔ Ba a wosɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Honhom Kronkron de Yesu kɔɔ ɛserɛ so. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Ɔtenaa hɔ adaduanan a na obiara nka ne ho ka wiram mmoa nko ara. Ɛhɔ na ɔbonsam sɔɔ no hwɛeɛ. Akyire yi, abɔfoɔ ba bɛsom no.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Ɔhene Herode kyeree Yohane akyi no, Yesu kɔɔ Galilea kɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛberɛ no awie du! Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn. Monnu mo ho na monnye asɛmpa no nni!”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asuafoɔ A Wɔdi Ɛkan No Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu nam Galilea mpoano no, ɔhunuu Simon ne ne nua Andrea sɛ wɔregu asau. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommɛdi mʼakyi! Na mɛma mo ayɛ nnipayifoɔ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Ɛhɔ ara, wɔgyaa wɔn asau no guu hɔ bɛdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra no, ɔhunuu Sebedeo mma baanu a wɔfrɛ ɔbaako Yohane, ɛnna ɔbaako nso Yakobo, sɛ wɔte kodoɔ mu reyɛ wɔn asau ho adwuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Ɔfrɛɛ wɔn nso sɛ wɔmmɛdi nʼakyi. Ntɛm ara, wɔgyaa wɔn agya Sebedeo ne nʼapaafoɔ hɔ wɔ kodoɔ no mu bɛdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Honhommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yesu ne nʼakyidifoɔ yi bɛduruu Kapernaum. Na Homeda duruiɛ no, ɔkɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔkaa asɛmpa no. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Nnipa no tee asɛm no no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkasaa te sɛ obi a ɔwɔ tumi, na mmom wankasa sɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔbarima bi a ɔwɔ wɔn hyiadan no mu hɔ a ɔwɔ honhommɔne teaam mu sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Ɛdeɛn na wo Nasareni Yesu ne yɛn wɔ yɛ? Woaba sɛ worebɛsɛe yɛn anaa? Menim wo sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba Kronkronni no!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu teateaa honhommɔne no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mua wʼano! Firi ne mu kɔ!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Honhommɔne no wosoo saa ɔbarima no, ma ɔteateaam den na ɛtu kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Nnipa no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn, ma wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ. “Nkyerɛkyerɛ foforɔ bɛn ni? Ahonhommɔne mpo tie ne nne!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Saa anwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛeɛ yi ho nsɛm trɛ faa Galileaman mu nyinaa.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Wɔfirii hyiadan no mu no, wɔne Yakobo ne Yohane kɔɔ Simon ne Andrea efie. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Na Simon ase baa ɛda mpa so a huraeɛ akyere no, na wɔkaa ne ho asɛm kyerɛɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesu kɔɔ baabi a ɔda hɔ, kɔsɔɔ ne nsa, ma ɔsɔre tenaa ase. Ɛhɔ ara, huraeɛ no tu firii ne so. Ɔsɔre noaa aduane maa wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, nnipa no de ayarefoɔ ne wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnsa wɔn yadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Kuro mu no nyinaa bɛboaa wɔn ho ano wɔ efie no aboboano, <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>na Yesu saa ayarefoɔ bebree yadeɛ. Ɔtuu ahonhommɔne bebree nso. Nanso, wamma ahonhommɔne no ankasa, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnim no.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Twee Ne Ho Kɔbɔɔ Mpaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Ahemadakye a na ɛnim nteteeɛ no, Yesu sɔre firii efie hɔ kɔɔ baabi a ɛhɔ yɛ dinn, kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simon ne wɔn a wɔka ne ho firii adi kɔhwehwɛɛ no, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>na wɔhunuu no no, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nnipa bebree rehwehwɛ wo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ nkuro a aka no so, na mekɔka mʼasɛm kyerɛ wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛno enti na mebaeɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Enti, ɔkɔɔ Galileaman mu baabiara kɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ asɔredan mu, tuu ahonhommɔne bebree nso.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Ɔkwatani Bi Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Ɔkwatani bi bɛkotoo no srɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, wobɛtumi ama me ho ate.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu hunuu ɔkwatani no mmɔbɔ, enti ɔde ne nsa kaa no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mepɛ! Wo ho mfi!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ne ho teeɛ, maa ne ho tɔɔ no!<verse eid="MRK 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesu bɔɔ nʼano dendeenden sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><char style="wj">“Nka saa asɛm yi nkyerɛ obiara, na mmom, fa wo ho kɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfoɔ. Sɛ worekɔ a, fa wʼafɔrebɔdeɛ a Mose ahyɛ sɛ akwatafoɔ a wɔasa wɔn yadeɛ mfa nka wɔn ho nkɔ no ka wo ho kɔ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma obiara ahunu sɛ wo ho atɔ wo bio.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Nanso, ɔrekorɔ no nyinaa, na ɔde nteateamu rebɔ nʼayaresa no ho dawuro. Esiane yei enti, sɛ Yesu kɔ baabiara a, nnipadɔm bɛtwa ne ho hyia. Ɛno enti, afei baabiara a ɔbɛkɔ no, ɔnnyi ne ho adi. Enti, ɔtenaa ɛserɛ so hɔ maa nnipa bebree baa ne nkyɛn wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Obubuafoɔ Bi Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Nna bi akyi no, Yesu kɔɔ Kapernaum bio. Ɔduruu hɔ no nnipa pii tee sɛ waba hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Ankyɛre na nnipa bebree bɛhyɛɛ efie a na ɔwɔ mu no mu ma tɔ. Ɔkaa asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Mmarima baanan bi de obubuafoɔ bi a wɔso no baa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔntumi mfa nnipadɔm no mu nkɔ Yesu nkyɛn no enti, wɔforoo ɛdan a Yesu wɔ mu no, kɔtuu tokuro wɔ atifi. Wɔde obubuafoɔ a ɔda ne kɛtɛ so no faa mu, gyaagyaa no brɛoo de no kɔtoo Yesu anim. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn gyidie a wɔwɔ wɔ ne mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔyarefoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔba, wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo!”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Nanso Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no tee deɛ Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔdwenee wɔ wɔn tirim <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>sɛ, “Asɛm bɛn na ɔreka yi! Abususɛm na ɔreka yi! Ɔdwene sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn? Onyankopɔn nko na ɔtumi de bɔne kyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwene no, ɛhɔ ara, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na moma asɛm a mekaeɛ yi ha mo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ mmerɛ? Sɛ obi bɛka akyerɛ obubuafoɔ no sɛ, ‘Wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo’, anaasɛ, ‘Fa wo kɛtɛ na nante’?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/><char style="wj">Enti mɛkyerɛ mo sɛ Onipa Ba no wɔ tumi sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ.”</char> Enti ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/><char style="wj">“Mese wo sɛ, sɔre gyina hɔ. Fa wo kɛtɛ, na kɔ wo efie na wo ho atɔ wo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Obubuafoɔ yi sɔre bobɔɔ ne kɛtɛ, na ɔde anigyeɛ ne ahosɛpɛ faa nnipadɔm no mu kɔeɛ. Nnipa no ho dwirii wɔn, ma wɔkamfoo Onyankopɔn sɛ, “Yɛnhunuu yei bi da!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu sane kɔɔ mpoano hɔ bio, na ɔkaa asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ nnipakuo a wɔahyia wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔnam mpoano hɔ no, ɔhunuu Alfeo ba Lewi sɛ ɔte atogyeɛ. Ɔhunuu no no ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi.”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, Lewi sɔre dii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Saa ɛda no anadwofa, Lewi too ɛpono, too nsa frɛɛ nʼafɛfoɔ ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ bi sɛ wɔmmra na ɔne wɔn ne Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no nto nsa nnidi. Nnipa a wɔdii Yesu akyi no bi te sɛ Lewi ara pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Farisifoɔ no hunuu sɛ ɔne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ne ɔtogyefoɔ ato nsa redidi no, wɔbisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na ɔne ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ to nsa didi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesu tee deɛ wɔkaeɛ no, ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔn a wɔwɔ ahoɔden no, ɔyaresafoɔ ho nhia wɔn, na wɔn a wɔyare no na ɔyaresafoɔ ho hia wɔn. Mamma sɛ merebɛka akyerɛ teneneefoɔ sɛ wɔnsakyera wɔn adwene na mmom, nnebɔneyɛfoɔ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmuadadie Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Ɛda bi a Yohane Osubɔni akyidifoɔ ne Farisifoɔ no redi mmuada no, nnipa bi kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na Yohane ne Farisifoɔ no akyidifoɔ di mmuada na wʼakyidifoɔ deɛ, wɔnni mmuada?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Moahunu ayeforɔkunu nnamfo a wɔbɛba ayeforɔ ase a wɔbɛka sɛ, wɔredi mmuada enti wɔrennidi anaa? Mmerɛ dodoɔ a wɔne ayeforɔkunu no nam no deɛ, wɔrenni mmuada da.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/><char style="wj">Nanso, ɛda bi bɛba a, wɔbɛfa ayeforɔkunu no afiri wɔn nkyɛn. Saa ɛberɛ no na wɔbɛdi mmuada.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛte sɛ wode ntoma foforɔ atare ntoma dada mu. Ɛdeɛn na ɛba? Ntaremu no bɛte ntoma dada no mu, na ayi afiri mu, na ama tokuro a ɛda hɔ no aso asene kane deɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/><char style="wj">Monim sɛ, wɔmfa nsã foforɔ ngu aboa nwoma nkotokuo dada mu. Anyɛ saa a, ɛbɛpae. Nsa no bɛhwie agu, na nkotokuo a nsã no wɔ mu no nso bɛpaapae. Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsã foforɔ gu nkotokuo foforɔ mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Homeda Die Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Homeda bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ nam aburoofuo bi mu no, asuafoɔ no pempan aburoo no bi weeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Farisifoɔ no bi ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɛnni ho kwan sɛ wɔyɛ saa! Yɛn mmara mma ho ɛkwan sɛ wɔbu aburoo Homeda.”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkenkanee deɛ Ɔhene Dawid yɛeɛ, ɛberɛ a ɛkɔm dee ɔne wɔn a na wɔka ne ho no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><char style="wj">ne sɛdeɛ ɔkɔɔ Onyankopɔn efie, Ɔsɔfopanin Abiatar berɛ so, na ɔne wɔn a wɔka ne ho kɔdii burodo a wɔde abɔ afɔdeɛ ama Onyankopɔn no, a obiara nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔdi, agye asɔfoɔ nko ara no pɛn? Na ɛno nso tia mmara.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onipa enti na wɔyɛɛ Homeda, na ɛnyɛ Homeda enti na wɔbɔɔ onipa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/><char style="wj">Na me, Onipa Ba no mpo, meyɛ Homeda no nso wura!”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Obi A Ne Nsa Awuo Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesu baa Kapernaum no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu bio. Ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔhunuu ɔbarima bi a ne nsa baako awu. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Na saa ɛda no yɛ Homeda enti na Yesu atamfoɔ no retetɛ no ahwɛ sɛ ɔbɛsa ɔbarima no yadeɛ anaa. Na wɔabɔ wɔn tirim sɛ, sɛ ɔsa no yadeɛ a, wɔbɛkyere no! <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre gyina nnipa no anim.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Ɔdanee ne ho kyerɛɛ nʼatamfoɔ no bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ sɛ obi yɛ papa Homeda? Anaasɛ ɛyɛ ɛda a wɔde yɛ bɔne? Ɛyɛ ɛda a wɔde gye nkwa anaa wɔma obi nkwa hwere no”</char> Nanso, wɔammua no.<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Ɔde abufuo hwɛɛ wɔn hyiaeɛ. Ɛhaa no sɛ wɔnni ahummɔborɔ mma nnipa enti ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Tene wo nsa no mu.”</char> Ɔtenee mu, na amonom hɔ ara, ne nsa no yɛɛ yie. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Farisifoɔ no kɔhyiaa Herodefoɔ no ne wɔn susuu ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so akum Yesu no ho.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipadɔm Tu Di Yesu Akyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no firii hɔ kɔɔ mpoano. Nnipadɔm fifiri Galilea, Yudea, Yerusalem, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Idumea, Asubɔnten Yordan agya, Tiro ne Sidon fam nyinaa, tu dii Yesu akyi. Ɛfiri sɛ, na nʼanwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛ no atrɛ afanan nyinaa enti na ebinom pɛ sɛ wɔbɛhwɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, wɔmpɛ kodoɔ bi nsi nkyɛn baabi, na sɛ nnipadɔm no kyere ne so wɔ mpoano hɔ a, watena mu akɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Ɛda no, na wasa nyarewa bebree. Nanso, na ayarefoɔ no ba ara na wɔreba a wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ka nʼatadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Ɛberɛ biara a wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne no bi bɛhunu no no, wɔtwa hwe fam, woso biribiri, ka sɛ, “Woyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nanso, ɔbɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ, wɔnnkyerɛ onipa ko a ɔyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asuafoɔ Dumienu No Yie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Akyire yi, ɔkɔɔ bepɔ so frɛɛ wɔn a wayi wɔn no baa ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Ɔyii wɔn mu dumienu a daa wɔne no bɛnante, na wɔakɔka asɛmpa no, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>na wɔatu ahonhommɔne nso.<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Dumienu a ɔyii wɔn no din nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simon a ɔtoo no din foforɔ Petro.<verse eid="MRK 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane nso, ɔfrɛɛ wɔn Boanerges a, aseɛ ne aprannaa mma.<verse eid="MRK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Wɔn a wɔka ho nso nie: Andrea,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Bartolomeo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Alfeo ba Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadeo, ne</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Simon ɔmanyɛfoɔ,<verse eid="MRK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>ɛnna Yuda Iskariot a ɔyii no maeɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Ɔsane baa efie a ɔte mu no mu no, nnipakuo bi sane baa ne so bio. Ankyɛre koraa na ɛhɔ nyinaa yɛɛ ma a ɔnnya ɛkwan koraa nnidi. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Ne fiefoɔ tee asɛm a aba no, wɔkɔɔ hɔ sɛ wɔrekɔfa no akɔ wɔn efie ɛfiri sɛ, wɔkaa sɛ, “Ne tiri mu ka no.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ka Nyaatwomfoɔ Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wɔfiri Yerusalem baeɛ no kaa sɛ, “Beelsebul a ɔyɛ ahonhommɔne panin no afa no, na ɔnam saa tumi no so na ɔtu ahonhommɔne no.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na Ɔbonsam bɛtumi atu Ɔbonsam?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/><char style="wj">Ahennie biara a ɛne ne ho di asie no bɛgu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na efie biara a ɛne ne ho di asie no nnyina ara ne no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ Ɔbonsam twa ne ho ne ne ho di asie a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na watumi adi nkonim? Ɔbɛdi nkoguo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/><char style="wj">Obiara ntumi nkɔ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ efie nkɔfa ne nneɛma kwa, agye sɛ, onii no di ɛkan kyekyere ɔhoɔdenfoɔ no, ansa na watumi afa ne nneɛma.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, bɔne a onipa ayɛ biara no, wɔtumi de kyɛ no, na mpo obi ka abususɛm tia me a, wɔtumi de kyɛ no;</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><char style="wj">nanso deɛ ɔka abususɛm tia Honhom Kronkron no deɛ, wɔremfa nkyɛ no da. Ɛyɛ bɔne a ɛrempepa da.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔka sɛ, “Ɔwɔ honhommɔne.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Maame Ne Ne Nuanom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ɔgu so rekyerɛkyerɛ no, ne maame ne ne nuanom bɛgyinaa nnipadɔm no mu baabi somaa obi sɛ, ɔnkɔfrɛ no mmra, na wɔne no nkasa. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na nnipadɔm no atwa ne ho ahyia. Nnipa no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Wo maame ne wo nuanom gyina afikyire hɔ pɛ sɛ wɔne wo kasa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan ne me maame? Ɛhefoɔ ne me nuanom?”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Ɔhwɛɛ nnipadɔm no hyiaeɛ kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yeinom ne me maame ne me nuanom!</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ no, ɔno ne me nuabarima ne me nuabaa ne me maame.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogufoɔ Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔgu so rekyerɛkyerɛ no, nnipadɔm sane bɛtwaa ne ho hyiaeɛ wɔ mpoano hɔ. Yei enti, ɔkɔtenaa kodoɔ mu, toaa ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no so. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Na sɛdeɛ ɔyɛ daa no, ɔnam mmɛbuo so kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn. Baako a ɔkaeɛ ne sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/><char style="wj">“Ɛda bi, ogufoɔ bi kɔɔ nʼafuom kɔguu aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/><char style="wj">Ɔgu so regu aba no, aba no bi guu kwankyɛn, maa nnomaa bɛsosɔɔ ne nyinaa diiɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/><char style="wj">Ebi nso kɔguu ɔbotan bi so. Nanso, dɔteɛ a ɛwɔ so no nnɔɔso.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/><char style="wj">Ankyɛre na ɛfifiriiɛ, nanso ɛsiane sɛ dɔteɛ a ɛwɔ ɔbotan no so no nnɔɔso no enti, owia bɔɔ so no, ne nyinaa hyeeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu nkasɛɛ mu, maa nkasɛɛ no kyekyeree no enti antumi anso aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu asase pa mu, maa ebi nyini soo mmɔho aduasa, ebi aduosia, ɛnna afoforɔ nso mmɔho ɔha!”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Na Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ma deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie!”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Akyire no a ɛkaa ɔne dumienu no ne asuafoɔ afoforɔ bi no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Asɛm a wokaeɛ no, aseɛ ne sɛn?” <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo deɛ, wɔada Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho ahintasɛm adi akyerɛ mo. Nanso, afoforɔ deɛ, wɔka no abɛbuo mu na ɛkyerɛ wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><char style="wj">Esiane saa nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Wɔhunu na wɔte, nanso wɔrente deɛ wɔte no ase,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">na wɔrennane mma Onyankopɔn nkyɛn,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">na wɔremfa wɔn bɔne nso nkyɛ wɔn.’</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ moante saa bɛ yi ase a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na moate mmɛ ahodoɔ a merebɛbuo no ase?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/><char style="wj">Ogufoɔ no gu aba a ɛyɛ asɛm no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu kwankyɛn no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm, nanso sɛ wɔte asɛm no a, ntɛm so, ɔbonsam ba wɔn nkyɛn, ma wɔn werɛ firi deɛ wɔate no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu ɔbotan so no gyina hɔ ma nnipa a wɔde anigyeɛ tie asɛm no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wɔte sɛ aba a afifiri foforɔ a ne nhini nkɔ fam. Ahyɛaseɛ no, wɔkɔ so fɛfɛɛfɛ, nanso sɛ ɛba sɛ asɛm no enti, ɔtaa anaa amanehunu bi to wɔn pɛ, na wɔapa aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu nkasɛɛ mu no nso gyina hɔ ma nnipa a wɔte asɛmpa no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/><char style="wj">nanso ɛnkyɛre koraa na ewiase yi mu afɛfɛdeɛ ne ahonyadeɛ ne ɔbra yi mu dadwene, nnaadaa ne nneɛma bi ho akɔnnɔ abɛhyɛ wɔn akoma mu. Yei enti, asɛm no ntumi nso aba biara.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu asase pa mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm no, na wɔso aba bebree. Nnipa no bi so mmɔho aduasa. Ebi nso so aduosia, na afoforɔ nso so ɔha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanea So Mfasoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Afei, Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Moahunu obi a ɔsɔ kanea na ɔde hyɛ mpa ase, anaasɛ ɔde ahina butu so? Dabi! Wɔde kanea si petee mu na ahyerɛn ma ɛho aba mfasoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ahinta biara no, wɔbɛda no adi, na deɛ wɔakata so biara no, wɔde bɛto dwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso a ɔbɛtie no, ma ɔntie!</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yie wɔ deɛ mote no ho. Deɛ mote no, ɛno ara na wɔde bɛma mo, na aboro so mpo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ biribi no, wɔbɛma no bi aka ho; deɛ ɔnni ahe bi no, kakraa a ɔwɔ no mpo, wɔbɛgye afiri ne nsam.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aba A Ɛrenyini Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Ɔkaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no teɛ nie: okuafoɔ bi gu aba wɔ asase bi so</char>. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Awia ne anadwo, sɛ ɔda o, sɛ ɔnyane o, aba no fefɛ a ɔnnim sɛdeɛ ɛyɛeɛ a ɛnyiniiɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/><char style="wj">Asase no ankasa bɔ nʼaduane, dua no na ɛdi kan, afei ɛpɛsɛ na abɔ, ama aba no anyini.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ aba no nyini wie a, okuafoɔ no fa ne dadeɛ kɔtwa, ɛfiri sɛ otwa berɛ aduru.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyina Aba Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Ɔsane kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn ho na yɛde Ɔsoro Ahennie no bɛto, anaa abɛbusɛm bɛn na yɛde bɛkyerɛkyerɛ mu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/><char style="wj">Ɛte sɛ onyina aba, a ɛyɛ ketewaa wɔ aba a wodua nyinaa mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wodua a ɛnyini yɛ kɛseɛ sene nnua a aka no nyinaa, ɛyiyi mman akɛseɛ ma ewiem nnomaa bɛsisi ne nwunu mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Mmɛbuo a ɛtete sɛ yeinom na Yesu de kaa asɛm no kyerɛɛ wɔn, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi ate aseɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Ɔnam mmɛbuo so na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔbɛtiee no no nyinaa, na sɛ ɛka ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no nko a, ɔkyerɛ wɔn ne nyinaa ase.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Brɛ Ahum Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma yɛntwa nkɔ asuogya nohoa.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Ɔkaa saa no, wɔgyaa nnipadɔm no wɔ hɔ, na ɔne wɔn kɔeɛ a akodoɔ foforɔ di wɔn akyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Prɛko pɛ, ahum kɛseɛ bi tuiɛ, maa asorɔkye bu bɛkataa kodoɔ no so, ma ɛyɛɛ sɛ ɛremem. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Yesu wɔ kodoɔ no to de ne ti ato sumiiɛ so ada. Asuafoɔ no de ahopopoɔ ne nteateamu kɔnyanee no kaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛreyɛ amem yi, ɛmfa wo ho?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Ɔsɔre teateaa mframa no ka kyerɛɛ ɛpo no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛ dinn!”</char> Mframa no gyaeeɛ, na ɛpo no yɛɛ dinn!<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na moyɛ ahufoɔ sei? Adɛn, monnye me nni anaa?”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Na wɔn ho dwirii wɔn yie, bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Onipa bɛn ni a mframa ne ɛpo mpo tie no yi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Ɔbarima Bi A Ɔwɔ Honhommɔne Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ bɛduruu ɛpo no fa baabi wɔ Gerasefoɔ asase so. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Ɔresi afiri kodoɔ no mu no, ɔbarima bi a honhommɔne wɔ ne mu de mmirika firi amusieeɛ bɛhyiaa no. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Na saa ɔbarima yi te amusieeɛ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Ɔyɛ obi a na ne ho yɛ den yie enti, sɛ wɔde nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mpo gu ne nsa a, ɔtumi bubu mu a obiara ntumi nkɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Anadwo ne awia nyinaa na ɔnenam amusieeɛ hɔ mmepɔ no mu a, ɔde aboɔ a ano yɛ nam twitwa ne ho.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Ɔbarima yi hunuu Yesu wɔ akyirikyiri no, ɔtuu mmirika, bɛbuu no nkotodwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Ɔteateaam sɛ, “Yesu, Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn no Ba, ɛdeɛn na wowɔ ne me yɛ? Mesrɛ wo, ɛnyɛ me ayayadeɛ biara!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Yesu tiaa honhommɔne a ɛwɔ ɔbarima no mu no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Honhommɔne, firi ne mu fi!”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔfrɛ wo sɛn?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Ɔbuaa Yesu sɛ, “Me din de ‘Ɛdɔm’ ɛfiri sɛ, yɛdɔɔso.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Afei, ɔsrɛɛ Yesu anibereɛ so sɛ ɔmmpam wɔn nkɔ akyirikyiri.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na mprakokuo bi redidi wɔ bepɔ no nkyɛn baabi a ɛbɛn ɛpo no. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Enti, ahonhommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Tu yɛn na yɛnkɔhyɛ mprako no mu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu maa wɔn ho ɛkwan ma wɔkɔhyɛɛ mprako no mu. Mprako no de ahoɔherɛ sianee bepɔ no kɔguu ɛpo no mu ma ɛfaa wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Mprakohwɛfoɔ no dwane baa nkuro a ɛbɛn hɔ no mu bɛkaa deɛ wɔahunu no kyerɛɛ wɔn. Wɔn a wɔteeɛ no kɔhwɛɛ deɛ asie no. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Nnipakuo no duruu baabi a Yesu wɔ no, wɔhunuu ɔbarima a na honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma no sɛ ɔte hɔ dinn a nʼadwenem ate no. Yei maa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Wɔn a wɔhunuu asɛm a asi no ka kyerɛɛ afoforɔ, <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>maa nnipakuo no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, ɔmfiri wɔn nkyɛn nkɔ, na wɔn ho ntɔ wɔn!<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Enti, ɔsane foro kɔtenaa kodoɔ no mu. Ɔbarima a na honhommɔne wɔ ne mu no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔne no kɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Nanso, Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Dabi, na kɔ na kɔka anwanwadeɛ a Onyankopɔn ayɛ ama wo yi ne nʼahummɔborɔ ho asɛm kyerɛ wʼabusuafoɔ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Enti, ɔbarima no firi hɔ kɔɔ Dekapoli, “Nkuro Edu” no a, ɛwɔ saa ɔmantam no mu, kɔkaa anwanwadeɛ a Yesu ayɛ ama no no kyerɛɛ obiara. Wɔtee asɛm no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu de kodoɔ no tware baa ɛpo no fa baabi no, nnipakuo bɛtwaa ne ho hyiaa wɔ mpoano hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Asafopanin bi a na ɔwɔ hɔ a wɔfrɛ no Yairo no, buu Yesu nkotodwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>srɛɛ no sɛ, ɔnsa ne babaa yadeɛ mma no. Ɔfiri ahoyera mu ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Abɔfra no rewu, enti mesrɛ wo sɛ, fa wo nsa bɛka no na ɔnnya nkwa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesu ne no kɔeɛ a nnipakuo no di wɔn akyi.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Na ɔbaa bi a watu mogya mfirinhyia dumienu ka nnipakuo no ho. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Ɔde ne yadeɛ no akyin ayaresafoɔ bebree so, atua sika bebree ama wayɛ ohiani, nanso na ne ho ntɔ no ara. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Na wate anwanwadeɛ a Yesu ayɛ no nyinaa, na ɛno enti ɔde ne ho fraa nnipakuo no, firii Yesu akyi sɔɔ nʼatadeɛ ano. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ɔdwenee ho kaa sɛ, “Sɛ metumi nya ne ho ɛkwan, de me nsa sɔ nʼatadeɛ mu kɛkɛ a, me ho bɛtɔ me.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Ampa ara, ɛsɔ a ɔsɔɔ nʼatadeɛ no mu pɛ, na mogya no twa maa ne ho tɔɔ no!<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Amonom hɔ ara, Yesu tee nka sɛ tumi bi afiri ne mu. Ɔdanee ne ho kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no bisaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan na ɔsɔɔ mʼatadeɛ mu no?”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Saa nnipakuo a obiara de ne ho twitwiri ne yɔnko yi na worebisa sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Hwan na ɔde ne nsa aka mʼatadeɛ?’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Nanso, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔhunu onipa ko a ɔsɔɔ nʼatadeɛ mu no. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔbaa no hunuu asɛm a asie no, ɔde ahopopoɔ bɛbuu Yesu nkotodwe kaa deɛ ɔyɛeɛ no kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbabaa, wo gyidie ama wo ho atɔ wo; fa asomdwoeɛ kɔ; wo yadeɛ no agyae.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yairo Babaa No Nyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Ɔgu so rekasa kyerɛ ɔbaa no no, abɔfoɔ firi Yairo efie bɛbɔɔ amaneɛ sɛ, Yairo babaa no awu, enti ɛho nhia sɛ Yesu bɛba bio.<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Yesu antie deɛ na wɔreka no koraa, na ɔka kyerɛɛ Yairo sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro, gye di ara.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Afei, Yesu amma obiara anni nʼakyi ankɔ Yairo efie hɔ gye Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu duruu hɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ ɛhɔ nyinaa ayɛ manyamanya a nnipa retwa agyaadwoɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Ɔkɔɔ efie no mu ne wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no kɔkasaeɛ. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn ne agyaadwotwa ne gyegyeegye yi? Abɔfra no nwuiɛ; nna na wada!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no tee asɛm a Yesu kae no, wɔseree no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ efie hɔ no sɛ, wɔn nyinaa mfiri adi. Ɔne abɔfra no agya ne ne maame ne nʼasuafoɔ baasa no kɔɔ deɛ abɔfra no da hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Ɔsɔɔ abɔfra no nsa kaa sɛ, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Talita, Kumm!”</char></char> a aseɛ ne sɛ <char style="wj">“Abaayewa, mese wo sɛ sɔre!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Amonom hɔ ara, abaayewa no sɔreeɛ, na ɔfiri aseɛ nanteeɛ. Na saa abaayewa no adi mfeɛ dumienu. Asɛm a ɛsiiɛ yi maa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn yie. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ wɔnnka asɛm a asie no nkyerɛ obiara, na mmom, wɔmma abɔfra no aduane nni.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifoɔ A Ɔnni Animuonyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesu firi baabi a ɔwɔ hɔ kɔɔ ne kurom a nʼasuafoɔ no ka ne ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu Homeda, hyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛeɛ, maa dodoɔ a wɔbɛtiee no ho dwirii wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Wobisaa sɛ, “Ɛhe na saa onipa yi nyaa saa nneɛma yi, ɛdeɛn nyansa na wɔde ama no a enti ɔtumi yɛ anwanwadeɛ yi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Ɛnyɛ dua dwumfoɔ ba no ni? Ɛnyɛ Maria babarima a ne nuanom ne Yakobo, Yosef, Yuda ne Simon no nie? Ɛnyɛ yɛne ne nuammaanom na ɛte ha!” Na wɔn bo fuu no.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Odiyifoɔ kurom, nʼabusuafoɔ mu, ne ne fie na ɔnni animuonyam.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Wantumi anyɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ wɔ hɔ, gye ayarefoɔ kakra bi na ɔde ne nsa guu wɔn so, saa wɔn yadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Gye a wɔannye no anni no yɛɛ no nwanwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu Soma Asuafoɔ Dumienu No</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Na Yesu kyinkyinii nkuraa ase kyerɛkyerɛeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ dumienu no baa ne nkyɛn, na ɔsomaa wɔn baanu baanu, maa wɔn tumi wɔ ahonhommɔne so.<verse eid="MRK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Akwankyerɛ a ɔde maa wɔn nie, <char style="wj">“Mommfa biribiara nkura gye mo poma nko ara; mommfa aduane anaa kotokuo anaa sika.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/><char style="wj">Bio, mommfa mpaboa foforɔ anaa atadeɛ foforɔ nka deɛ ɛhyɛ mo yi ho.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/><char style="wj">Baabiara a mobɛkɔ no, montena efie baako pɛ mu. Monnsesa mo atenaeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ morefiri kuro bi a wɔannye anaa wɔantie mo no mu akɔ a, momporoporo mo nan ase tutuo, mfa nni adanseɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Asuafoɔ no kɔkaa asɛm no kyerɛɛ obiara a wɔhyiaa no no sɛ ɔnnu ne ho, ntwe ne ho mfiri ne bɔne ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Na wɔtutuu ahonhommɔne bebree, de ngo sraa ayarefoɔ pii saa wɔn yadeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni No Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Ɔhene Herode tee yei, ɛfiri sɛ na Yesu din atrɛ. Ebinom kaa sɛ, “Yohane Osubɔni no na wasane aba nkwa mu bio, enti na ɔtumi yɛ anwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛ yi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Ebinom nso susuu sɛ, Yesu yɛ Odiyifoɔ Elia na wasane aba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, odiyifoɔ foforɔ bi a ɔte sɛ tete adiyifoɔ akɛseɛ no bi na waba.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Herode kaa sɛ, “Dabi, ɛyɛ Yohane Osubɔni a metwaa ne ti no. Wanyane afiri owuo mu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Herode asoma asraafoɔ ma wɔakɔkyere Yohane de no ato afiase, ɛfiri sɛ, na Yohane akasa atia Herode ne Herodia a na ɔyɛ Herode nua Filipo yere no awadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Yohane Osubɔni ka kyerɛɛ Herode sɛ, “Wonni ho ɛkwan sɛ woware wo nua yere.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Asɛm a Yohane kaeɛ no anyɛ Herodia nso dɛ, ma ɔnyaa ne ho menasepɔ kaa sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum Yohane. Nanso, ɔrentumi nku no gye sɛ Herode ama no tumi. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Na Herode de obuo ma Yohane, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔnim sɛ ɔyɛ onipa tenenee. Yei enti, ɔbɔɔ ne ho ban. Ɛberɛ biara a Horode ne Yohane bɛkasa no, na ne ho yera no, nanso yei nyinaa akyi no, ɔde ntoboaseɛ tiee no.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Deɛ Herodia pɛɛ sɛ ɛnyɛ Yohane no baa mu. Ɛne sɛ, na Herode redi nʼawoda, ma ɔtoo ɛpono wɔ nʼahemfie maa ne mpanimfoɔ, nʼasafohene ne Galilea mpanimfoɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22-23"/>Herodia babaa bɛsa kyerɛɛ wɔn ma ɛyɛɛ wɔn nyinaa fɛ. Herode de ntamka kyerɛɛ ababaawa no sɛ, “Bisa me biribiara a wopɛ; sɛ mʼahemman mu fa mpo na wopɛ koraa a, mede bɛma wo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:22-23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Ababaawa yi kɔɔ ne maame nkyɛn kɔbisaa no deɛ ɔmmisa, ma ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Bisa no Yohane Osubɔni ti!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Ababaawa yi de ahoɔherɛ sane baa ɔhene no nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mepɛ sɛ wode Yohane Osubɔni tiri to prɛte mu ma me seesei ara!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Yei maa ɔhene no werɛ hoeɛ, nanso ɛsiane sɛ na waka ntam wɔ nnipa no anim no enti, wammu ɛbɔ a ɔhyɛɛ ne babaa no so. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Herode somaa nʼasraafoɔ no mu baako sɛ ɔnkɔ afiase hɔ nkɔtwa Yohane ti mfa mmrɛ no. Ɔsraani no kɔtwaa Yohane Osubɔni ti, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>na ɔde too prɛte mu de brɛɛ ababaawa no maa ɔde kɔmaa ne maame. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Ɛberɛ a Yohane asuafoɔ no tee deɛ asi no, wɔbɛfaa nʼamu no kɔsiee no wɔ ɔboda bi mu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpemnum Aduane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Asomafoɔ no sane baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkaa deɛ wɔyɛeɛ ne deɛ wɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔkɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn no nyinaa kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Yesu tiee wɔn amaneɛ no wieeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma yɛntwe yɛn ho mfiri nnipakuo yi ho, na yɛnkɔhome kakra.”</char> Deɛ ɛma ɔkaa saa ne sɛ, na nnipa a wɔba wɔn nkyɛn no to ntwa da. Wɔnnya ɛkwan mpo na wɔadidi.<verse eid="MRK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no tenaa kodoɔ mu kɔɔ baabi a obiara nni hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a wɔrekɔ no, nnipa pii hunuu wɔn, na wɔtuu mmirika faa mpoano hɔ kɔhyiaa wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yei enti, ɛberɛ a Yesu sii fam no, na nnipakuo ahyia wɔ hɔ. Ɔhunuu wɔn no, ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔte sɛ nnwan a wɔnni ɔhwɛfoɔ. Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn nneɛma bebree a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhunu.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Onwunu reyɛ adwo no, nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn, bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Adeɛ resa. Aduane biara nso nni ha. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Ka kyerɛ nnipa no na wɔnkɔ nkuro mu ne nkuraa a atwa yɛn ho ahyia yi ase, na wɔnkɔtɔ aduane bi nni.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma wɔn aduane nni.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ansa na yɛbɛtumi ama saa nnipa dodoɔ yi aduane no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛnya abosome nwɔtwe akatua. Sɛ yɛse yɛbɛma wɔn aduane a, yɛrennya saa nnipakuo yi ho sika!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Burodo ahe na yɛwɔ? Monkɔ na monkɔhwɛ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Wɔsane ba bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wɔwɔ burodo enum ne mpataa mmienu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no sɛ, wɔntenatena ase, na wɔtenatenaa ase akuakuo wɔ ɛserɛ no so. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Enti, wɔtenatenaa ase akuakuo a ebi yɛ ɔha na ebi yɛ aduonum. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yesu faa burodo enum ne mpataa mmienu no, na ɔhwɛɛ ɔsoro, bɔɔ mpaeɛ, hyiraa so. Ɔbubuu burodo no mu de maa asuafoɔ no sɛ wɔnkyɛ mma nnipa no. Na ɔkyɛɛ mpataa no nso maa wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Nnipa no dii aduane no maa obiara meeɛ! <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Nnipa a wɔdii aduane no bɛyɛ mmarima mpemnum; <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>na wɔtasee aseɛ nkaeɛ no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛmma dumienu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nante Nsuo Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Adidie no akyi pɛ, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, wɔnkɔtena kodoɔ no mu, na wɔnni ɛkan nkɔ Betsaida, na ɔregya nnipakuo no ɛkwan na wati wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Akyire yi, ɔkɔɔ bepɔ no so kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Anadwo no a asuafoɔ no te kodoɔ mu aduru nsuo no mfimfini no, na Yesu nko ara na ɔwɔ mpoano. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Ɔhunuu sɛ na wɔn ho akyere wɔn; ɛne sɛ, mframa a ano yɛ den ne asorɔkye bɔ dweradweraa kodoɔ no, enti na wɔrebrɛ ɔkodoɔ no hare mu. Anɔpahema bɛyɛ sɛ nnɔnmiɛnsa berɛ mu no, ɔnantee nsuo no ani baa wɔn nkyɛn. Ɔyɛɛ sɛ ɔretwa wɔn ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Ɛberɛ a asuafoɔ no hunuu obi sɛ ɔnam nsuo no ani no, wɔde ehu teateaam ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔsusu sɛ wɔahunu ɔsaman. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Wɔn nyinaa hunuu no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Ɛhɔ ara, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam. Ɛyɛ me! Monnsuro!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Afei, ɔkɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn wɔ kodoɔ no mu no, mframa no gyaeeɛ! Asuafoɔ no ho dwirii wɔn, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnnte aduanema no ase, na wɔapirim wɔn akoma.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Genesaret Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Wɔtwaa asuo no baa Genesaret na wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔde kodoɔ no baa mpoano. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Na wɔsi firii kodoɔ no mu no, nnipa a wɔgyina hɔ no hunuu no. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Wɔtuu mmirika kyinii nkuro a atwa hɔ ahyia no nyinaa so soaa nnipa a wɔyare da wɔn kɛtɛ so brɛɛ no wɔ baabiara a wɔtee sɛ ɔwɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Na nkuraa ase anaa nkuro so baabiara a ɔkɔreɛ no, wɔde ayarefoɔ bɛguu mmɔntene so, srɛɛ no sɛ, ɔmma wɔmfa wɔn nsa nka nʼatadeɛ ano kɛkɛ. Ayarefoɔ dodoɔ a wɔtumi de wɔn nsa kaa nʼatadeɛ ano no ho yɛɛ wɔn den.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Fam Ahoteɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Ɛda bi, Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ binom a wɔfiri Yerusalem baa Yesu nkyɛn. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔhunuu sɛ nʼasuafoɔ no bi redidi a wɔanhohoro wɔn nsa ho. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Na Yudafoɔ no, ne titire no Farisifoɔ no, nnidi da, gye sɛ wɔahohoro wɔn nsa ho nyinaa, sɛdeɛ wɔn amanneɛ kyerɛ, ansa na wɔadidi. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Na sɛ wɔfiri dwa so ba a, wɔhohoro wɔn nsa ansa na wɔadidi. Yei yɛ mmara bebree a wɔfiri tete adi so no mu baako. Na mmara no bi ne sɛ, wɔhohoro nkuruwa, asɛn ne nwowa mu.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Enti, Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wʼasuafoɔ no nni yɛn amanneɛ a ɛfiri tete no so? Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔdidi a, wɔnni ɛkan nhohoro wɔn nsa sɛdeɛ amanneɛ kyerɛ no.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nyaatwomfoɔ! Asɛm a Yesaia ka faa mo ho sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Saa nnipa yi de wɔn ano na ɛdi me ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">nanso wɔn akoma mmɛn me ho baabiara no yɛ nokorɛ turodoo!</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔsom me kwa;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ yɛ nnipa nsa ano mmara’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Mogya Onyankopɔn mmara a wahyehyɛ no de mo ankasa mo amanneɛ si ananmu.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moahyɛ da sɛ mobɛpo Onyankopɔn mmara no, na moatiatia so, ama mo amanneɛ no atim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/><char style="wj">Ɛho nhwɛsoɔ bi ne sɛ, Mose de Onyankopɔn mmara a ɛka sɛ, ‘Di wʼagya ne wo maame ni’ no maa.</char> Ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">‘obiara a ɔbɛkasa atia nʼagya anaa ne maame no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/><char style="wj">Nanso, moka sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ obi bɛka akyerɛ nʼagya anaa ne maame a adeɛ bi hia no no sɛ, ‘Merentumi mmoa mo! Ɛfiri sɛ, mede deɛ anka ɛsɛ sɛ mede ma mo no ama Onyankopɔn.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/><char style="wj">Enti, mobu Onyankopɔn mmara a ɔhyɛeɛ no so, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛtumi abɔ mo amanneɛ ho ban.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/><char style="wj">Yei yɛ nhwɛsoɔ baako pɛ. Nanso, bebree ka ho.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Afei, Yesu frɛɛ nnipakuo no baa ne nkyɛn, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa montie asɛm a mereka yi yie, na monte aseɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/><char style="wj">Adeɛ biara a ɛkɔ onipa mu no, ngu ne ho fi. Na mmom, deɛ ɛbɛfiri onipa mu aba no, na ɛgu ne ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso a ɔbɛtie no ntie.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Afei, Yesu firii nnipakuo no mu kɔɔ efie no, nʼasuafoɔ no bisaa no asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no ase. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nso monte asɛm a mekaeɛ no ase? Monhunu sɛ, deɛ modie no ngu mo ho fi anaa?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ modie biara no ne mo akoma nni hwee yɛ, na mmom, ɛfa ɔyafunu no mu kɛkɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Ɔtoaa so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɛfiri onipa mu ba no na ɛgu ne ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/><char style="wj">Afei, deɛ ɛfiri nnipa akoma mu ba no, ɛde adwamammɔ, korɔno, awudie,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/><char style="wj">adifudepɛ, amumuyɛ, nsisie, ahohwie, anibereɛ, abususɛm, ahantan ne nkwaseasɛm ba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Saa nnebɔne yi nyinaa firi onipa mu na ɛba, na ɛnonom na ɛgu onipa ho fi a ɛmma ɔmfata Onyankopɔn anim.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Bi Gyidie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesu firi hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ Tiro ne Sidon fam pɛɛ sɛ ɔrekɔhyɛ hɔ komm a, obiara nte ne nka, nanso anyɛ yie. Ɛda a ɔduruu hɔ ara pɛ, na nkurɔfoɔ tee ne nka sɛ waba hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Ɛhɔ ara na ɔbaa bi a honhommɔne hyɛ ne babaa ketewa bi mu baa ne nkyɛn. Na wate Yesu nka enti, ɔbɛbuu no nkotodwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Ɔbaa no srɛɛ no sɛ ɔntu saa honhommɔne no mfiri ne ba no mu mma no. Na saa ɔbaa yi yɛ Helani a wɔwoo no wɔ Siro-Foinike.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ mma no mee ansa. Na ɛnyɛ sɛ wɔde mma aduane ma nkraman.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Ɔbaa no nso buaa no sɛ, “Owura, ɛyɛ nokorɛ deɛ, nanso ɛyɛ a, wɔde aduane a aka wɔ mmɔfra no prɛte mu no bi ma nkraman a wɔhyehyɛ ɛpono no ase no.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo mmuaeɛ pa no enti, masa wo babaa no yadeɛ. Kɔ efie. Honhommɔne no afiri ne mu afi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Ɔduruu efie no, ɔhunuu sɛ ne babaa no da mpa so dinn a honhommɔne no afiri ne mu ampa ara.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumu Sotifoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesu firi Tiro no, ɔfaa Sidon mansini a emu nkuro yɛ edu no so, bɛduruu Galilea Po so. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Wɔde ɔsotifoɔ bi a ɔsane yɛ mumu brɛɛ no. Wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, ɔmfa ne nsa nka ɔyarefoɔ no, na ɔnsa no yadeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu sɔɔ ne mu de no firii nnipakuo no mu. Afei, ɔde ne nsateaa hyɛɛ ɔbarima no asom, tee ntasuo de kaa ne tɛkrɛma. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Ɔhwɛɛ soro, guu ahome teaam sɛ, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Hefata!”</char></char> Aseɛ ne, <char style="wj">“bue!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔbarima no tumi tee asɛm, na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kasaeɛ!<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesu bɔɔ nnipakuo no ano sɛ, wɔmmmɔ asɛm no dawuro nkyerɛ obiara. Nanso, mpɛn dodoɔ a ɔbraa wɔn no, na trɛ ara na wɔn nso wɔretrɛ asɛm no mu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Saa asɛm yi maa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn yie. Enti, wɔkaa sɛ, “Yesu ayɛ adeɛ nyinaa yie, ɔma asotifoɔ mpo te asɛm, na mumu nso kasa!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa Mpemnan Aduanema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Ɛda koro bi a nnipakuo bi aba Yesu nkyɛn no, aduane a wɔdi no saeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa yi yɛ me mmɔbɔ. Wɔabɛdi nnansa wɔ ha a, wɔnni aduane biara a wɔbɛdi bio.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ megya wɔn ɛkwan sɛ wɔnkɔ a wonnidiiɛ a, anhwɛ a na wɔn mu bi atotɔ baha wɔ ɛkwan so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn mu bi firi akyirikyiri na wɔbaeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhefa na yɛbɛnya aduane ama saa nnipa dodoɔ yi wɔ ɛserɛ yi so ha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Burodo ahe na mowɔ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Yɛwɔ nson.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no sɛ wɔntenatena ase wɔ ɛserɛ no so. Afei, ɔfaa burodo nson no, na ɔhyiraa so, bubuu mu de maa nʼasuafoɔ no ma wɔkyɛ maa nnipa no. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Na wɔwɔ mpataa kakra wɔ hɔ, enti Yesu hyiraa ɛno nso so, de maa asuafoɔ no sɛ wɔnkyɛ ɛno nso mma wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Nnipakuo no didi meeɛ no, ɔgyaa wɔn ɛkwan. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Nnipa a wɔdii aduane no dodoɔ bɛyɛ mpemnan. Na wɔtasee aseɛ nnikaeɛ no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛmma nson. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Yei akyi no, ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔtenaa kodoɔ mu baa Dalmanuta fam.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsoro Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Farisifoɔ no tee sɛ Yesu aba hɔ no, wɔbaa ne nkyɛn bɛbisabisaa no nsɛm, de sɔɔ no hwɛɛ. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi kyerɛ yɛn. Ma nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi nna adi wɔ ewiem nkyerɛ yɛn. Ɛno ansa na yɛbɛgye wo adi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu tee deɛ wɔkaeɛ no, ɔguu ahome, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛn enti na mohwehwɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ daa yi? Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ biara nni hɔ a mɛyɛ akyerɛ mo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Ɔsane kɔtenaa kodoɔ no mu, gyaa wɔn, tware kɔɔ asuogya nohoa.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herode Ne Farisifoɔ Mmɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Asuafoɔ no werɛ firii sɛ wɔfa aduane bi kura ansa na wɔakɔ. Aduane a na wɔkura wɔ kodoɔ no mu no yɛ burodo baako pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Wɔretwa asuo no no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie wɔ Ɔhene Herode ne Farisifoɔ mmɔreka ho.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Asuafoɔ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Asɛm a ɔreka yi ase ne sɛn?” Deɛ wɔn adwene kyerɛɛ wɔn ne sɛ, ebia ɔreka aduane a wɔn werɛ firii sɛ wɔbɛfa akuta no ho asɛm.<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesu hunuu deɛ wɔdwennwene no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ ɛno ho asɛm na mereka! Monnte yei ase anaa? Mo akoma da so pirim?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Mowɔ ani nso monhunu adeɛ? Mowɔ aso nso momfa nte asɛm? Na monnkae biribi anaa?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ a mebubuu burodo enum mu maa nnipa mpemnum no, nnikaeɛ nkɛntɛmma ahe na motaseeɛ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wɔkaa sɛ, “Dumienu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mesane de burodo nson maa nnipa mpemnan no nso, ahe na ɛkaeɛ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wɔkaa sɛ, “Nkɛntɛmma nson.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnte ase ara anaa?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onifirani Bi Ayaresa Wɔ Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu Betsaida no, nnipa bi de onifirani bi brɛɛ no, srɛɛ no sɛ ɔmfa ne nsa nka no, na ɔnsa no yadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu sɔɔ onifirani yi nsa de no kɔɔ akuraa no kurotia. Ɔtee ntasuo guu onifirani no ani so, na ɔde ne nsa guu no so. Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wohunu adeɛ anaa?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Onifirani no maa nʼani so hwɛɛ ɔsoro, buaa sɛ, “Aane, mehunu nnipa! Nanso mehunu wɔn sɛ nnua bi na wɔnenam hɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Afei, Yesu de ne nsa kataa nʼani no so bio. Onifirani no buee nʼani, na ɛberɛ a ɔrehwɛ adeɛ haa no, nʼani no yɛɛ yie a afei deɛ na ɔhunu biribiara kann. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu ma ɔkɔɔ efie, ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsane nkɔ akuraa no ase bio.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Ka Sɛ Yesu Ne Kristo No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no firi Galilea kɔɔ Kaesarea ne Filipi nkuraa ase. Wɔnam ɛkwan so rekɔ no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa ka sɛ mene hwan?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Asuafoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Ebinom se wone Yohane Osubɔni no, na afoforɔ nso se woyɛ Elia anaasɛ tete adiyifoɔ no mu bi a wasane aba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Na ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Na mo nso mose meyɛ hwan?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petro buaa no sɛ, “Wone Kristo no.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Ɔbɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛ, wɔnnka nkyerɛ obiara.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Owuo Ne Ne Wusɔreɛ Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Afei, ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ Onipa Ba no bɛhunu amane, na mpanimfoɔ, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no bɛpo no, na wɔakum no, na nnansa so, Onipa Ba no bɛsɔre. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Ɔkaa asɛm no pefee a wamfa biribiara ansie wɔn. Petro twee no gyinaa nkyɛn, bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na woka asɛm a ɛte sɛɛ yi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Yesu danee ne ho hwɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no, kaa Petro anim sɛ, <char style="wj">“Firi me so, ɔbonsam! Wʼadwene yɛ deɛ ɛfiri onipa na ɛnyɛ deɛ ɛfiri Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahopakyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Afei, ɔfrɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no ne nnipakuo no baa ne nkyɛn, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmmɛtie no. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔdi mʼakyi a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔpa ne ho akyi, na ɔsoa nʼasɛnnua, na ɔdi mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔma ne ɔkra som no bo no, ɛbɛfiri ne nsa. Na deɛ me ne Asɛmpa no enti, ɔbɛhwere ne kra no, wɔbɛgye ne nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ onipa nya ewiase nyinaa, na ɔhwere ne kra a, mfasoɔ bɛn na ɔbɛnya?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/><char style="wj">Ɛdeɛn na ɛsom bo sene ne kra?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a saa nna bɔne yi mu nʼani wu me ne me nsɛm ho no, ne ho bɛyɛ me, Onipa Ba no, aniwu ɛberɛ a me ne mʼabɔfoɔ kronkron no bɛsane aba wɔ mʼAgya animuonyam mu no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Animuonyam Da Adi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yesu kɔɔ so ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo a mogyina ha yi mu bi bɛtena ase akɔsi sɛ mobɛhunu sɛ, Onyankopɔn Ahennie no reba tumi mu!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Nnansia akyi, Yesu faa Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane de wɔn kɔɔ bepɔ tentene bi atifi. Saa ɛberɛ no, na obiara nni hɔ ka wɔn ho. Amonom hɔ ara, Yesu sakyerae animuonyam mu. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Nʼatadeɛ hyerɛn yɛɛ fitafita sene sɛdeɛ obi bɛtumi ahoro saa atadeɛ no ama ayɛ fitaa no. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Afei Elia ne Mose bɛfirii hɔ. Na wɔne Yesu kasaeɛ!<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ɛyɛ sɛ yɛwɔ ha. Yɛbɛbɔ asese mmiɛnsa wɔ ha, wo deɛ baako, Mose deɛ baako na Elia deɛ baako.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔabɔ hu no enti na ɛma ɔkaa saa.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Na omununkum bɛkataa wɔn so. Ɛnne bi firii omununkum no mu kaa sɛ, “Yei ne me Dɔ Ba. Montie no.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Prɛko pɛ, wɔtotoo wɔn ani no, wɔanhunu obiara ka Yesu ho.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Wɔresiane afiri bepɔ no so no, Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ wɔnnka deɛ wɔahunu no nkyerɛ obiara kɔsi sɛ Onipa Ba no bɛsɔre afiri awufoɔ mu. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Asuafoɔ no anka ankyerɛ obiara, na mmom, ɛyɛ a, na wɔtaa bisabisa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, nʼasɛm a ɔkaa sɛ, “Mɛnyane afiri awufoɔ mu” no, na ɔkyerɛ sɛn?<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Afei, nʼasuafoɔ no bisaa no deɛ enti a daa mmara no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no ka sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia sane ba ansa na Onipa Ba no aba no.<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Yesu gye too mu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia di ɛkan ba bɛtoto nneɛma nyinaa yie. Ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ na adɛn enti na wɔatwerɛ sɛ Onipa Ba no bɛhunu amane bebree na wɔapo no?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/><char style="wj">Nanso me se mo sɛ, Elia aba dada! Na wɔne no anni no yie sɛdeɛ adiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ho nkɔm no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Abarimaa Bi A Ɔwɔ Honhommɔne Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔsiane bɛduruu bepɔ no ase hɔ no, wɔhunuu sɛ nnipakuo atwa asuafoɔ a wɔaka no ho ahyia, na wɔne mmara no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no regye wɔn ho wɔn ho akyinnyeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipakuo no hunuu Yesu no wɔn ho dwirii wɔn, na wɔde mmirika, bɛhyiaa no.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Akyinnyeɛ a na moregye no fa ɛdeɛn ho?”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Nnipa no mu baako kaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, mede me ba aba ha sɛ sa no yadeɛ. Honhommɔne bi a ɛwɔ ne so enti, ɔntumi nkasa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Sɛ honhommɔne no ka ne ho wɔ ne mu a, ɛtwa no hwe fam, ma nʼano twa ahuro, ma ɔtwɛre ne se, ma ɔsensene. Ɛno enti, mesrɛɛ wʼasuafoɔ no sɛ wɔntu honhommɔne no mfiri ne mu, nanso wɔantumi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“O, mo a mo gyidie sua, me ne mo ntena nkɔsi da bɛn ansa na mo gyidie atim? Momfa abarimaa no mmrɛ me.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Wɔde abarimaa no brɛɛ Yesu. Ɛberɛ a wɔde no duruu Yesu anim pɛ no, yadeɛ no baa dendeenden, twaa no hwee fam, ma ɔperee ara a nʼano retwa ahuro.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu bisaa abarimaa no agya sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nna ahe ni a yadeɛ yi baa ne so?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Abarimaa no agya buaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɛfiri ne mmɔfraase pɛɛ; <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>na ɛtɔ ɛda bi koraa a, yadeɛ no tumi twa no hwe ogya anaa nsuo mu, pɛ sɛ ɛkum no. Enti, sɛ wobɛtumi asa no yadeɛ deɛ a, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ, na sa no yadeɛ ma yɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na woka sɛ, sɛ mɛtumi a? Nneɛma nyinaa bɛtumi ayɛ hɔ ama obiara a ɔgye die.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Abarimaa no agya buaa sɛ, “Mewɔ gyidie nanso ɛsua, enti boa me, na hyɛ me gyidie mu den!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ nnipa no dɔ ara na wɔredɔɔso no, ɔteaa honhommɔne no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Honhommɔne sotifoɔ ne mumu, mehyɛ wo sɛ, firi abɔfra yi mu fi. Nkɔhyɛ ne mu bio!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Afei, yadeɛ no baa dendeenden ansa na ɛrefiri ne mu, enti ɛmaa abarimaa no yɛɛ sɛ owufoɔ. Enti, nnipakuo no kasaa huhuhuhu sɛ, “Wawu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Nanso, Yesu sɔɔ ne nsa, pagyaa no ma ɔgyinaa ne nan so a ne ho atɔ no.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yei akyi a Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no nko ara wɔ efie no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na yɛn deɛ yɛantumi antu saa honhommɔne no?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mpaeɛbɔ nko ara na ɛbɛtumi atu saa yadeɛ yi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Owuo Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Yesu firii hɔ no, ɔfaa Galilea, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔmpɛ sɛ nnipa te ne nka. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Na ɔpɛ sɛ ɔnya berɛ ma nʼasuafoɔ no de kyerɛkyerɛ wɔn. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔbɛyi Onipa Ba no ama, na wɔakum no, na ne nnansa so, ɔbɛsɔre aba nkwa mu bio.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Asuafoɔ no ante asɛm a ɔkaeɛ yi ase, nanso na wɔsuro sɛ wɔbɛbisa no aseɛ.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hwan Ne Ɔkɛseɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no baa Kapernaum. Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu efie a wɔbɛtena mu no mu na wɔregye wɔn ahome no, Yesu bisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛreba no, ɛdeɛn akyinnyeɛ na na moregye wɔ ɛkwan so no?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Asuafoɔ no antumi ammua ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔredwennwene deɛ ɔbɛyɛ wɔn mu kɛseɛ no ho.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Ɔtenaa ase, frɛɛ wɔn baa ne nkyɛn, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔpanin wɔ mo mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ abɔfra anaa ɔsomfoɔ wɔ mo mu!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Afei, ɔde abɔfra ketewa bi bɛgyinaa wɔn mfimfini. Ɔde abɔfra no kyerɛɛ wɔn kaa sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><char style="wj">“Mo mu biara a me enti ɔbɛgye abɔfra ketewa sɛ yei no, agye me, na deɛ ɔbɛgye me no nso agye mʼAgya a ɔsomaa me no!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deɛ Ɔntia Yɛn No Wɔ Yɛn Afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohane a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ no mu baako no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛhunuu ɔbarima bi a ɔde wo din retu ahonhommɔne enti yɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnnyae, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnka yɛn ho.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnsi no ɛkwan. Ɛfiri sɛ, obiara nni hɔ a ɔreyɛ anwanwadeɛ wɔ me din mu na ɔbɛtwa ne ho atia me,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><char style="wj">na obiara a ɔntia yɛn no wɔ yɛn afa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɛsiane sɛ, moyɛ Kristo dea no enti, ɔbɛma mo nsuo kuruwa ma anom no, nʼakatua remmɔ no da.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ obi to mmɔfra nketewa a wɔgye me di yi mu bi suntidua a, ɛyɛ ma no sɛ anka wɔde ɛboɔ duruduru bɛsɛn ne kɔn mu, ato no atwene ɛpo mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wo nsa ma woyɛ bɔne a, twa na to twene. Ɛyɛ ma wo sɛ wode dɛm bɛkɔ nkwa mu sene sɛ, wode wo onipadua nyinaa bɛto amanehunu ogya</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/><char style="wj">a ɛnnum da no mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wo nan ma woyɛ bɔne a, twa na to twene. Ɛyɛ ma wo sɛ wode nansin bɛkɔ nkwa mu sene sɛ, wode nan mmienu bɛkɔ amanehunu ogya</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/><char style="wj">a ɛnnum da no mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wʼani ma woyɛ bɔne a, tu na to twene. Ɛyɛ ma wo sɛ wode ani baako bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu sene sɛ wowɔ ani mmienu na wɔde wo bɛto amanehunu ogya mu,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><char style="wj">baabi a</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ogya no ɛnnum da,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">na ɛhɔ asonsono nso nwu da.’</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>
    <char style="wj">Na wɔde ogya bɛhyɛ wɔn nyinaa nkyene.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nkyene yɛ dɛ, nanso sɛ nkyene yera ne dɛ a, ɛho nni mfasoɔ; wonte ne dɛ wɔ biribiara mu. Enti, monnyera mo dɛ! Mo ne mo ho mo ho ntena asomdwoeɛ mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyaeɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Afei, Yesu firii Galilea twa baa Yudea fam no hɔ wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan agya. Nnipakuo baa ne nkyɛn, na sɛdeɛ ɔtaa yɛ no, ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Farisifoɔ bi baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Wopene awaregyaeɛ so anaa?” Wɔbisaa no yei de sɔɔ no hwɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na Mose ka faa awaregyaeɛ ho?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Mose kaa sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ wɔgyae awadeɛ. Nʼasɛm a ɔkaeɛ ne sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi pɛ sɛ ɔgyaa ne yere awadeɛ a, ɔntwerɛ awaregyaeɛ krataa mfa mma ne yere no.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na ɔkaa saa? Merebɛkyerɛ mo deɛ enti a ɔkaa saa. Esiane mo akoma a apirim no enti na ɔkaa saa kyerɛɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri adebɔ ahyɛaseɛ na Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ɔbarima ne ɔbaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><char style="wj">Yei enti na ɔbarima bɛgya nʼagya ne ne maame,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><char style="wj">na ɔde ne ho akɔbɔ ne yere ho, na wɔn baanu no ayɛ honam korɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ Onyankopɔn aka abom no, ɛnsɛ sɛ onipa tete mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Akyire no a ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no wɔ efie no, asuafoɔ no bisaa no saa asɛm korɔ no ara bio. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi gyaa ne yere awadeɛ na ɔsane ware obi foforɔ a, na wabɔ adwaman.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔyere gyaa ne kunu awadeɛ, na ɔsane ware a, ɔno nso abɔ adwaman saa ara.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyira Mmɔfra Nkumaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Ɛda bi, awofoɔ bi de mmɔfra nkumaa brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnhyira wɔn, nanso nʼasuafoɔ no pampam wɔn a wɔde mmɔfra no baeɛ no, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔnnha no. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesu hunuu deɛ nʼasuafoɔ no ayɛ no, anyɛ no dɛ na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma mmɔfra no ɛkwan na wɔmmra me nkyɛn, na monnsi wɔn ɛkwan, na yeinom sei na Onyankopɔn Ahennie no yɛ wɔn dea.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔrennye Onyankopɔn Ahennie no sɛ abɔfra no, ɔrentumi nhyɛne mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Na ɔyɛɛ wɔn atuu, de ne nsa guu wɔn so, hyiraa wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aberanteɛ Sikani No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Na ɔsiim sɛ ɔrekɔ baabi foforɔ no, ɔbarima bi tutuu mmirika baa ne nkyɛn bɛbuu no nkotodwe, bisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ pa, Ɛdeɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na wofrɛ me onipa pa? Obiara nyɛ onipa papa gye ɔbaako; ɔne Onyankopɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛfa wʼasɛmmisa no ho nso, wonim mmaransɛm no: Nni awu, mmɔ adwaman, mmɔ korɔno, nni atorɔ, nsisi, di wʼagya ne wo maame ni.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Aberanteɛ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yeinom nyinaa mefiri me mmɔfraase na medii so.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu hwɛɛ aberanteɛ yi dinn, nyaa ɔdɔ bi maa no. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aka wo adeɛ baako. Kɔ na kɔtɔn biribiara a wowɔ, na fa sika no ma ahiafoɔ, na wobɛnya agyapadeɛ wɔ ɔsoro, na bra bɛdi mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Aberanteɛ no tee saa asɛm yi no, nʼanim sesaeɛ, na ɔde awerɛhoɔ kɔeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔwɔ ahonyadeɛ bebree.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Ɔrekɔ no, Yesu hwɛɛ no na ɔdanee ne ho ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ den ma osikani sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu!”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no maa asuafoɔ no ho dwirii wɔn. Yesu sane kaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me mma, sɛ moahunu den a ɛyɛ ma wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonyadeɛ sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/><char style="wj">Na ɛyɛ mmerɛ sɛ yoma bɛfa paneɛ aniwa mu sene sɛ osikani bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Asuafoɔ no ho dwiri wɔn mmorosoɔ na wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ na hwan na wɔbɛgye no nkwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn dinn kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onipa fam deɛ, yei rentumi mma mu, na Onyankopɔn fam deɛ, biribiara bɛtumi aba mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyiridie Mu Akatua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Afei, Petro hyɛɛ aseɛ kenkanee nneɛma a ɔne asuafoɔ no agya abɛdi Yesu akyi. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Yɛagya biribiara abɛdi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu nso buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, obi nni hɔ a, me enti wagya efie, nuammarimanom, nuammaanom, maame, agya ne mma anaasɛ agyapadeɛ a ɔbɛkɔ akɔka Asɛmpa no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/><char style="wj">na ɔrennya efie, nuammarimanom, nuammaanom, maamenom, mma ne nsase mmɔho ɔha a ɔtaa nso ka ho! Yeinom nyinaa bɛyɛ ne dea wɔ asase yi so, na ewiase a ɛreba no mu deɛ, ɔbɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Na adikanfoɔ pii bɛdi akyire, na akyikafoɔ abɛdi ɛkan.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Owuo Ne Ne Wusɔreɛ Ho Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmiɛnsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Afei, wɔsiim sɛ wɔrekɔ Yerusalem a na Yesu di wɔn ɛkan; na ɛberɛ a asuafoɔ no di nʼakyi no, ehu ne suro kaa wɔn. Yesu twee wɔn gyinaa nkyɛn, na ɔsane kaa nneɛma a, sɛ wɔduru Yerusalem a, ɛbɛba ne so no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ yɛduru hɔ a, wɔbɛyi me, Onipa Ba no ama asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, na wɔabu me kumfɔ, na wɔde me ahyɛ Roma aban nsa, na wɔakum me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛdi me ho fɛw, na wɔatete ntasuo agu me so, na wɔde mpire atwa me mmaa, na wɔakum me, na nnansa so no, masɔre bio.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Ne Yohane Abisadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Afei, Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛpɛ sɛ woyɛ yɛn adɔeɛ bi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na mopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma mo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Wobuaa sɛ, “Ma yɛn mu baako ntena wo nifa so, na ɔbaako nso ntena wo benkum so wɔ wʼahennie mu hɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Nanso, Yesu maa wɔn mmuaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnim deɛ mobisa no! Mobɛtumi anom awerɛhoɔ kuruwa nwononwono a ɛsɛ sɛ menom ano no anaa? Anaasɛ, mobɛtumi ama wɔde amanehunu asubɔ no abɔ mo asu?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛbɛtumi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mobɛtumi anom me kuruwa ano, na wɔde asubɔ a wɔde bɔ me no abɔ mo;</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/><char style="wj">nanso menni tumi sɛ meyi wɔn a wɔbɛtena me nifa anaa me benkum so no. Onyankopɔn nko ara na ɔde saa afa no bɛma wɔn a wɔasiesie hɔ ama wɔn no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Asuafoɔ a aka no tee deɛ Yakobo ne Yohane kɔbisaeɛ no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Enti, Yesu frɛɛ wɔn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monim sɛ ahene ne atumfoɔ a wɔwɔ ewiase no di wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn ase no so,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/><char style="wj">nanso mo deɛ, ɛnte saa wɔ mo ho. Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ kɛse wɔ mo mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo ɔsomfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ne nuanom so panin no ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ wɔn nyinaa akoa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/><char style="wj">Me a meyɛ Onipa Ba no, mamma sɛ wɔnsom me na mmom, mebaeɛ sɛ merebɛboa afoforɔ, na mede me kra ayɛ mpata ama nnipa pii.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onifirani Bi Adehunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no bɛduruu Yeriko. Wɔrefi kuro no mu no, nnipakuo tu dii wɔn akyi. Saa ɛberɛ a Yesu retwa mu no, na onifirani Bartimeo a ne din nkyerɛaseɛ ne “Timoteo ba” no te kwankyɛn resrɛsrɛ adeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Ɛberɛ a Bartimeo tee sɛ Yesu Nasareni na ɔretwam no, ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ teateaam sɛ, “Dawid Ba Yesu, hunu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Nnipa no bi teateaa no sɛ, “Mua wʼano!” Nanso ɔkɔɔ so teateaam denden sɛ, “Dawid ba, hunu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu tee ne nne no, ɔgyina kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfrɛ no mma me.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Wɔfrɛɛ onifirani no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ma wo bo ntɔ wo yam, sɔre na ɔrefrɛ wo!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Bartimeo to ne ntoma guiɛ, sɔre baa Yesu nkyɛn.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na wopɛ sɛ meyɛ mema wo?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Onifirani no buaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, mepɛ sɛ mehunu adeɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ, na wo gyidie agye wo.”</char> Na ntɛm ara onifirani no hunuu adeɛ, na ɔdii Yesu akyi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no rebɛn Yerusalem, na wɔduruu Betfage ne Betania a ɛwɔ Ngo Bepɔ no ho no, Yesu somaa nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu, dii wɔn anim ɛkan. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ akuraa a ɛwɔ hɔ no ase. Sɛ moduru hɔ a, mobɛhunu sɛ wɔasa afunumu ba bi a wɔntenaa ne so da ahoma. Monsane no, na momfa no mmrɛ me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ obi bisa mo sɛ ɛdeɛn na moreyɛ a, monka no tiawa sɛ, ‘Ne ho hia Awurade, na ɔbɛsane de no aba seesei ara.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Asuafoɔ baanu no siim. Wɔkɔhunuu sɛ aboa no sa efie bi aboboano. Enti, wɔsanee no. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Wɔgu so resane no no, nnipa bi a wɔgyina nkyɛn bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moresane afunumu ba no?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Wɔkaa asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no kyerɛɛ nnipa no ma wɔtee wɔn aseɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Wɔde afunumu ba no brɛɛ Yesu, maa asuafoɔ no de wɔn ntoma guu aboa no so, maa Yesu tenaa ne so. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Nnipakuo a wɔwɔ hɔ no bi de wɔn ntoma sesɛɛ ɛkwan a ɔde aboa no nam so no so. Ebinom nso pempan nnua mman de sesɛɛ ɛkwan no mu saa ara. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Na Yesu di nnipakuo no mfimfini a wɔn nyinaa reteateam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosiana!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkamfoɔ</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Nhyira ne deɛ ɔnam Awurade din mu reba!”<verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>“Animuonyam nka Onyankopɔn sɛ yɛn agya Dawid ahennie reba.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hosiana wɔ ɔsorosoro!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu kɔduruu Yerusalem no, ɔkɔɔ asɔredan no mu. Ɔhwɛɛ biribiara a ɛwɔ hɔ dinn ansa na ɔrefiri hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, na onwunu redwo enti ɔne asuafoɔ dumienu no kɔɔ Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Dome Ankaa Dua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa a wɔrefiri Betania hɔ no, ɛkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Wɔkɔɔ kakra no, ɔhunuu sɛ borɔdɔma dua bi si hɔ a ayɛ kusuu. Ɔkɔɔ hɔ kɔhwɛɛ sɛ aduaba no bi wɔ so anaa. Nanso, ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ nhahan nko ara na ɛwɔ so. Saa ɛberɛ no nso, na ɛnyɛ ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ borɔdɔma no so. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Nanso, Yesu domee borɔdɔma dua no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, worenso aba bio!”</char> Asuafoɔ no tee asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Asɔrefie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Yesu sane baa Yerusalem no, ɔkɔɔ asɔrefie hɔ. Ɔduruu hɔ no, ɔpamoo adwadifoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa, kaa sikasesafoɔ apono nyinaa guu fam, bubuu pata a wɔtɔn mmorɔnoma wɔ mu no nyinaa, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>sii ɛkwan sɛ obiara mmɛdi dwa wɔ hɔ bio. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, ‘Mʼasɔrefie yɛ beaeɛ a wɔbɔ mpaeɛ,’ nanso mo deɛ, mode hɔ ayɛ akorɔmfoɔ atenaeɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ tee deɛ Yesu ayɛ no, wɔbɔɔ ne ho pɔ, pɛɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so ayi no afiri hɔ. Asɛm a na ɛha wɔn ne sɛ, sɛ wɔanhwɛ no yie nso a, ɛde basabasa bɛba, ɛfiri sɛ, na nnipa bebree agye Yesu nkyerɛkyerɛ no atom.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Sɛdeɛ na wɔtaa yɛ no, anwummerɛ no ara, wɔfirii kuro no mu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Borɔdɔma Dua A Ɛwuiɛ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Anɔpa a asuafoɔ no retwam wɔ borɔdɔma dua a Yesu domee no no ho no, wohunuu sɛ awu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petro kaee asɛm a Yesu ka de domee dua no no, ɔteaam sɛ, “Hwɛ, Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ! Borɔdɔma dua a wodomee no no awu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mowɔ gyidie wɔ Onyankopɔn mu a,</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><char style="wj">anka mobɛtumi aka akyerɛ Ngo Bepɔ yi sɛ, ‘Tutu kɔgu ɛpo mu,’ na ɛbɛtutu akɔgu mu nso. Monnye nni; mommma mo gyidie nhinhim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/><char style="wj">Montie deɛ mereka yi. Biribiara a mobɛbisa wɔ mpaeɛbɔ mu no, monnye nni sɛ mo nsa aka, na ɛbɛyɛ hɔ ama mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ morebɔ mpaeɛ a, deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, sɛ mowɔ obi ho asɛm a, momfa nkyɛ no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nso de mo bɔne bɛkyɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ moamfa bɔne ankyɛ a, saa ara na mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nso remfa mo bɔne nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tumi Ho Nsɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Wɔbaa Yerusalem bio. Wɔkɔɔ asɔrefie hɔ no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>“Tumi bɛn na wogyinaa so pamoo adwadifoɔ no?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu nso buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merebɛbisa mo asɛm baako bi na mommua me!</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa Yohane Osubɔni, anaa ɛnyɛ ɔno? Mommua me!”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Wɔdwennwenee ho kaa sɛ, “Sɛ yɛka sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no a,’ wɔbɛbisa yɛn deɛ enti a yɛannye deɛ Yohane kaeɛ no anni. <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Na sɛ yɛka sɛ, ‘Ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no nso a,’ ɛdɔm no bɛha yɛn. Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn nyinaa nim sɛ Yohane yɛ odiyifoɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Enti, wɔn mmuaeɛ a wɔmaeɛ ara ne sɛ, “Yɛrentumi mmua. Yɛnnim.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ monnim de a, me nso meremma mo asɛmmisa no ho mmuaeɛ!”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Bobeturo Mu Akuafoɔ Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Yesu nam mmɛbuo so kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ: <char style="wj">“Ɛda bi, okuafoɔ bi yɛɛ bobefuo, gyee ban faa ho, na ɔtuu amena bi a wɔkyi bobe mu nsuo wɔ mu, na ɔsii ɔwɛn aban wɔ mu. Afei, ɔde afuo no gyaa akuafoɔ bi, na ɔtuu ɛkwan.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Ɛduruu ɛberɛ a bobe no bereeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔte no, ɔsomaa ne ho onipa bi sɛ ɔnkɔgye ne kyɛfa mmrɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Nanso, akuafoɔ no boroo no, ma ɔde ne nsapan sane kɔeɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/><char style="wj">Okuafoɔ no sane somaa onipa foforɔ kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn, na ɔno nso, wɔboroo no, pirapiraa no sene deɛ ɔdi ɛkan no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Onipa a ɔsomaa no bio no deɛ, wɔkumm no. Afoforɔ a akyire no wɔkɔeɛ no nso, wɔhwee ebinom, na wɔkumm ebinom nso.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, na aka ɔbaako a ɔyɛ ne ba a ɔdɔ no. Ɔsomaa ɔno nso kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn, susuu sɛ wɔbɛfɛre no de anidie ama no.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ɛberɛ a akuafoɔ no hunuu no sɛ ɔreba no, wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Ɔdedifoɔ no na ɔreba no. Momma yɛnkum no, na agyapadeɛ no ayɛ yɛn dea!’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/><char style="wj">Wɔkyeree no, kumm no, twee no firii bobe turom hɔ kɔtoo no twenee baabi.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mogye di sɛ, sɛ afu wura no ba a ɛdeɛn na ɔbɛyɛ akuafoɔ no? Ɔbɛba abɛkum wɔn, na ɔde afuo no ama nnipa foforɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Monnkanee yei wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu pɛn sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɛboɔ a adansifoɔ apo no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">ɛno ara na abɛyɛ ɛdan no ntweaso tiboɔ;</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Awurade na wayɛ yei,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">na ɛyɛ nwanwa wɔ yɛn ani so?’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Na ɛsiane saa bɛ a ɔbuiɛ no enti, Yudafoɔ mpanin no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no, ɛfiri sɛ, wohunuu sɛ wɔn ho asɛm na ɔreka no a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔne saa akuafoɔ atirimuɔdenfoɔ no. Nanso na wɔsuro dɔm no. Yei ma wɔgyaee no, na wɔfirii hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtoɔ Gyeɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Wɔsomaa Farisifoɔ ne Herodefoɔ bi baa Yesu nkyɛn sɛ wɔne no mmɛkasa, na wɔnam nʼanom asɛm so anya no akyere no. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛnim sɛ woyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ a, wotaa ka nokorɛ. Deɛ onipa ka no ntumi nnane wʼadwene. Afei, wokyerɛkyerɛ nnipa Onyankopɔn akwan. Yɛpɛ sɛ yɛbisa wo sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ wɔyi toɔ ma Roma Hempɔn Kaesare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ɛyɛ asɛdeɛ sɛ ɔmanfoɔ tua toɔ ma Romahene. Na togyeɛ nsɔ ani koraa enti Yudafoɔ no bi ampɛ sɛ wɔbɛtua, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔgye di sɛ ɛtoɔ no tua no na ɛnyɛ Roma den ma wɔdi ɔman no so.</char></note> anaa ɛnyɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwemmɔne no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na mosɔ me hwɛ, momfa sika a wɔde yi toɔ no bi nkyerɛ me, na mɛma mo mmuaeɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Wɔde maa no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan mfoni ne atwerɛ na ɛwɔ so?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Kaesare deɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ momfa Kaesare deɛ mma no, na momfa Onyankopɔn deɛ mma Onyankopɔn!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ne mmuaeɛ no maa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔreɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Afei, Sadukifoɔ a wɔka sɛ owusɔreɛ nni hɔ no, baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, Mose yɛɛ mmara maa yɛn sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi anwo na ɔwu a, ne nuabarima mfa ne yere no kunabaa na ɔne no nwo mma mma owufoɔ no. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Anuanom baason bi tenaa ase. Deɛ ɔdi ɛkan no waree yere, na ɔne no anwo na ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Na deɛ ɔtɔ so mmienu no nso waree okunafoɔ no, na ɔno nso, ankyɛre na ɔwuiɛ a ɔne no anwo. Na deɛ ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no nso waree no a, ɔne no anwo na ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Yei kɔɔ so kɔsii sɛ, anuanom yi nyinaa waree ɔbaa no, na ɔbaa no nso wuiɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Deɛ yɛpɛ sɛ yɛhunu ne sɛ, owusɔreɛ no mu, sɛ wɔnya sɔre a, wɔn mu hwan na ɔbaa no bɛyɛ ne yere?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mfomsoɔ a moyɛ no firi nim a monnim Atwerɛsɛm no, ne Onyankopɔn tumi a ɔwɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Sɛ anuanom baason yi ne ɔbaa no sɔre firi awufoɔ mu a, wɔrenware; wɔbɛyɛ sɛ abɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Afei, ɛfa awufoɔ owusɔreɛ no ho no nso, monnkanee Mose nwoma no mu asɛm a ɛfa Mose ne wira a na ɛrehyeɛ no ho da? Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, ‘Mene Abraham Onyankopɔn, Isak Onyankopɔn ne Yakob Onyankopɔn.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/><char style="wj">Na Onyankopɔn reka akyerɛ Mose sɛ, ɛwom sɛ, saa nnipa yi awuwu mfeɛ pii a atwam no deɛ, nanso wɔte ase. Anyɛ saa a anka ɔrenka sɛ ɔyɛ ateasefoɔ Onyankopɔn, na ɔnyɛ awufoɔ Onyankopɔn. Moayɛ mfomsoɔ kɛseɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mu baako a ɔgyina hɔ retie no no hunuu sɛ, wabua wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛfata no, ɔbisaa no sɛ, “Mose mmaransɛm no mu deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa ne deɛ ɛka sɛ, ‘Israel, tie! Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn, yɛ Awurade korɔ;</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/><char style="wj">na dɔ Awurade wo Onyankopɔn firi wʼakoma ne wo kra ne wʼadwene ne wʼahoɔden nyinaa mu,’ no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu no ne: ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.’ Mmaransɛm bi nni hɔ a ɛkyɛn eyinom.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Atwerɛsɛm no ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Owura, woaka nokorɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn baako pɛ na ɔwɔ hɔ, na obi foforɔ nka ne ho, <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>na menim nso sɛ, sɛ mɛdɔ no afiri mʼakoma ne mʼadwene ne mʼahoɔden nyinaa mu, na mɛdɔ me yɔnko sɛ me ho no, sene afɔdeɛ biara a wɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ wabua asɛm no nyansa mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo ne Onyankopɔn Ahennie ntam ɛkwan nware.”</char> Na saa asɛm yi akyi, obi antumi ammisa no asɛm biara bio.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa Ba No Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Ɛberɛ bi a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, ɔbisaa nnipa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no ka sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Agyenkwa no yɛ Ɔhene Dawid ba?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ Dawid ankasa nam Honhom Kronkron mu kaa sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“Tena me nifa so</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">kɔsi sɛ mede wʼatamfoɔ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">bɛyɛ wo nan ntiasoɔ.” ’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ Dawid frɛ no ‘Awurade’ a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na watumi ayɛ ne ba?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ɛkwan a ɔfaa so kasaeɛ no maa nnipa no de anigyeɛ tiee no.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atwerɛfoɔ No Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Ɛberɛ bi a nnipakuo bi de anigyeɛ retie Yesu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho yie wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ho! Wɔhyɛ ntadeɛ akɛseɛ sɛ asikafoɔ na sɛ wɔnam badwa mu a, wɔpɛ sɛ obiara a ɔhyia wɔn no de obuo kyea wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔkɔ hyiadan mu a, wɔtenatena mpanin adwa so, na sɛ wɔkɔ adidie ase a, wɔtena mpanin tenabea.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɔ mpaeɛ hunu atentene kyerɛ nnipa sɛ wɔresom Onyankopɔn, nanso wɔsisi akunafoɔ. Yei enti wɔbɛnya asotwe a emu yɛ duru.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Kunafoɔ Hiani Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu kɔɔ asɔredan mu no, ɔkɔtenaa afɔrebɔ adaka a ɛsi hɔ no anim hwɛɛ sɛdeɛ nkurɔfoɔ no de sika regu adaka no mu. Asikafoɔ no de sika a ɛdɔɔso guu mu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Ɔbaa kunafoɔ hiani bi nso baeɛ na ɔde sika nketewa mmienu bɛguu mu.<verse eid="MRK 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Ɔfrɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Saa ɔbaa kunafoɔ hiani yi afɔdeɛ a ɔbɔeɛ no som bo sene afɔdeɛ akɛseakɛseɛ a asikafoɔ no bɛbɔeɛ no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn nyinaa firi deɛ wɔanya ama abu wɔn so no mu na wɔyiyii bi de baeɛ, na ɔbaa yi deɛ, ɔfiri ne hia mu de deɛ ɔwɔ nyinaa na abɛgu mu no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔredan No Sɛeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesu refiri asɔredan no mu hɔ no, nʼasuafoɔ no mu baako kaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, adan yi yɛ fɛ papa. Hwɛ sɛdeɛ wɔde aboɔ asiesie afasuo no.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ nokorɛ deɛ, nanso wɔbɛdwiri saa ɛdan yi agu pasaa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔte Ngo Bepɔ no so a nʼani tua Yerusalem no, Petro, Yakobo, Yohane ne Andrea baa ne nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Ɛberɛ bɛn na deɛ woreka fa asɔredan yi ho no bɛba mu. Na nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi bɛdi ɛkan aba ansa anaa?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yie na obi annaadaa mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bebree de me din bɛba abɛka sɛ wɔne Agyenkwa no, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Akokoakoko bɛsisi afanan nyinaa, nanso ɛnyɛ ɛnonom ne awieeɛ no ho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/><char style="wj">Aman bɛsɔre aman so, na ahennie asɔre ahennie so na asasewosoɔ ne ɛkɔm bɛba mmeammea. Yeinom nyinaa bɛyɛ nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu a ɛbɛba no mfitiaseɛ.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, sɛ yeinom fiti aseɛ sɛ ɛreba a, monhwɛ yie! Mobɛkɔ ɔhaw akɛseɛ mu. Esiane sɛ modi mʼakyi enti, wɔbɛtwe mo akɔ asɛnniiɛ; wɔbɛhwe mo wɔ asɔredan mu, na wɔaka nsɛm agu mo so wɔ ahemfo ne mpanimfoɔ anim. Saa ɛberɛ no ne berɛ pa a ɛsɛ sɛ moka Asɛmpa no kyerɛ wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/><char style="wj">Na ɛsɛ sɛ Asɛmpa no di ɛkan duru ɔman biara so ansa na awieeɛ no aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wɔkyere mo de mo bɛgyina asɛnniiɛ a, monnnwene deɛ mobɛka de ayi mo ho ano ho. Monka deɛ Onyankopɔn bɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monka no. Na ɛnyɛ mo na mobɛkasa, na Honhom Kronkron no na ɔbɛkyerɛ mo deɛ monka.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onua bɛyi onua ama sɛ wɔakum no. Saa ara na agyanom nso bɛyi wɔn mma ama. Mma bɛsɔre atia wɔn awofoɔ ama wɔakum wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><char style="wj">Me enti, nnipa nyinaa bɛtan mo. Nanso, deɛ ɔbɛtumi agyina pintinn akɔsi awieeɛ no, wɔbɛgye no nkwa.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, sɛ mohunu akyiwadeɛ a ɛbɔ ɔman wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ a, ɔkenkanfoɔ, hwɛ yie! Wɔn a wɔwɔ Yudea no nnwane nkɔ mmepɔ no so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ wɔn afie mu no nnwane a wɔnnsane nkɔ efie hɔ bio nkɔfa biribiara mmfiri hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ mfuom no nso nnsane wɔn akyi mmɛfa sika anaa ntoma wɔ efie.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔafa afuro ne wɔn a wɔturu mma saa ɛberɛ no mu no nnue.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/><char style="wj">Na mommɔ mpaeɛ na ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ modwane no anyɛ awɔberɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Na ahohia a ɛbɛba saa mmerɛ no mu no, ɛfiri ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn bɔɔ adeɛ no, ebi nsii da, na ebi nso rensi da.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gye sɛ Awurade twa saa amanehunu no so, anyɛ saa a, ɔkra baako koraa rentena ase. Nanso, ɛsiane wɔn a wɔayi wɔn no enti, ɔbɛtwa nna no so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Agyenkwa no ni’ a, mommua.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/><char style="wj">Atorɔ Kristo ne atorɔ adiyifoɔ bɛsɔre wɔ mo mu, na wɔayɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ, na sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, wɔadaadaa Onyankopɔn no ara ankasa mma.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ yie, ɛfiri sɛ, maka biribiara akyerɛ mo!</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ahohia no akyi no,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘owia bɛduru sum,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">na ɔsrane renhyerɛn,</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>
    <char style="wj">na nsoromma bɛtete ahwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">na wɔbɛwoso tumi a ɛwɔ ewiem no.’</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na nnipa nyinaa bɛhunu me, Agyenkwa no, sɛ mede tumi ne animuonyam nam omununkum mu reba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/><char style="wj">Na mɛsoma mʼabɔfoɔ akɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa, firi ɔsoro ano akɔka asase ano, na wɔabɛboaboa wɔn a mayi wɔn no ano.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, monsua biribi mfiri borɔdɔma dua no ho asɛm no mu. Sɛ ɛyi mman foforɔ, sane yi ahahan foforɔ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ asusɔ abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mohunu sɛ saa nneɛma yi a maka ho asɛm akyerɛ mo yi nyinaa afiti aseɛ resisi a, mobɛhunu sɛ me ba a mɛsane aba no abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛ me se mo sɛ, awontoatoasoɔ yi rentwam, gye sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa aba mu ansa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/><char style="wj">Ɔsoro ne asase bɛtwam akɔ, na me nsɛm deɛ, ɛrentwam da.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso ɛda anaa dɔn ko a awieeɛ no bɛba deɛ, obiara nnim. Ɔsoro abɔfoɔ ne mʼankasa mpo nnim. Agya no nko ara na ɔnim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ monnim berɛ ko a asɛm yi bɛsi enti, monsiesie mo ho. Monwɛn, ntwɛn me ba no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/><char style="wj">Me ba no te sɛ ɔbarima bi a ɔtuu ɛkwan kɔɔ ɔman foforɔ bi so. Ɔrebɛkɔ no, ɔkyerɛɛ adwuma a nʼapaafoɔ nyɛ. Ɛnna ɔka kyerɛɛ ne wɛmfoɔ nso sɛ, ɔnwɛn hɔ yie nkɔsi sɛ ɔbɛba.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, mo nso monwɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, monnim berɛ ko a efiewura no bɛba. Ɛbɛtumi aba sɛ ɔbɛba anwummerɛ, ɔdasuom, ahemadakye anaa awia.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ofu mu ba a, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbɛto mo sɛ moadeda.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a mede agya mo ne nnipa nyinaa ni. ‘Monwɛn.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔɔ Yesu Ho Pɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Aka nnanu na Twam Afahyɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛyɛ afahyɛ bi a wɔde kae ɛberɛ a Awurade bɔfoɔ bɛtwaam faa Hebrifoɔ anim na ɔkunkumm wɔn mmakan sɛdeɛ ɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraimfoɔ afie mu no. (Hwɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:11">2 Mose 12.11</ref></char>)</char></note> ne Apiti Afahyɛ a ɛyɛ Yudafoɔ ahomegyeɛ nna no aduru no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no hwehwɛɛ nyansakwan a wɔbɛfa so akye Yesu, akum no. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Nanso, wɔkaa sɛ, “Yɛrenkyere no afahyɛ no mu, anyɛ saa a ɛde basabasa bɛba ɔman no mu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsra Yesu Ngo Wɔ Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu wɔ Betania na ɔne Simon kwatani redidi no, ɔbaa bi a ɔkura ngo hwamhwam bi a ne bo yɛ den baa hɔ. Ɔtuu ano, hwie guu Yesu tirim.<verse eid="MRK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Deɛ ɔbaa yi yɛeɛ no anyɛ nnipa a wɔte adidiiɛ no mu bi dɛ. Na wɔkaa sɛ, “Wasɛe ngo no kwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Anka ɔbɛtumi atɔn ngo hwamhwam yi anya sika pii na ɔde ama ahiafoɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnyaa no! Adɛn enti na moreha no wɔ ade pa a ɔyɛeɛ no ho?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/><char style="wj">Mo ne ahiafoɔ a mobɛtumi aboa wɔn ɛberɛ biara mu na ɛte. Na me deɛ, merenkyɛ wɔ mo nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/><char style="wj">Wayɛ deɛ ɔbɛtumi. Wadi ɛkan asra me onipadua ama ɛda a wobɛsie me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/><char style="wj">Mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, baabiara a wɔbɛka Asɛmpa no wɔ ewiase no, wɔde deɛ ɔbaa yi yɛeɛ no bɛkae no, akamfo no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Pene So Sɛ Ɔbɛyi Yesu Ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Afei, Yuda Iskariot, asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako, kɔɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin no nkyɛn ne wɔn kɔhyehyɛɛ sɛdeɛ ɔbɛyi Yesu ama wɔn no ho. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin no tee asɛm no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn anigye ma wɔhyɛɛ no bɔ. Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, ɔhwehwɛɛ sɛdeɛ ɔbɛnya Yesu ho ɛkwan, ayi no ama ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Nʼasuafoɔ Adidie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Apiti Afahyɛ no ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan a wɔkum Twam Afahyɛ odwan no, nʼasuafoɔ bisaa no faako a wɔbɛkɔ akɔdi Twam Afahyɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Ɔsomaa nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu kɔɔ Yerusalem sɛ wɔnkɔsiesie baabi mma no. Deɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn ne sɛ, <char style="wj">“Morekɔ kuro no mu a, mobɛhyia onipa bi a ɔso ahina. Monni nʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Baabiara a ɔbɛwura no, monka nkyerɛ efiewura no sɛ, ‘Yɛn wura asoma yɛn sɛ, yɛmmɛhwɛ ɛdan a wɔasiesie ama yɛn a yɛbɛdi Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ mu no.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛkyerɛ mo abansoro asa kɛseɛ bi a wɔasiesie mu. Ɛhɔ na monyɛ ahoboa mma yɛn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Asuafoɔ baanu no siim kɔɔ kuro no mu, na wɔhunuu biribiara sɛdeɛ Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no pɛpɛɛpɛ, na wɔsiesiee Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, Yesu ne dumienu no baeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Na wɔte hɔ redidi no, Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, mo a me ne mo reto nsa adidi yi mu baako bɛyi me ama.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Wɔn nyinaa werɛ hoeɛ, na wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ bisaa mmaako mmaako sɛ, “Ɛyɛ me anaa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ mo dumienu a mo ne me reto nsa adidi yi mu baako.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no wu sɛdeɛ odiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ne ho nkɔm no; nanso onipa a ɔbɛyi Onipa Ba no ama no, nnue! Sɛ wanwo saa onipa no a, anka ɛyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi Kronkron Asehyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔredidi no, Yesu faa abodoo, na ɔhyiraa so bubuiɛ, na ɔde maa wɔn kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnye nni; yei ne me onipadua.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Afei, ɔfaa kuruwa a nsã wɔ mu, na ɔdaa ase no, ɔde maa wɔn, na wɔn nyinaa nom bi.<verse eid="MRK 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yei ne me mogya a ɛyɛ apam no mogya a ɛhyɛ Apam Foforɔ no mu den a bebree enti wɔrehwie agu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, merennom saa nsã yi bio da akɔsi ɛda a me ne mo bɛnom bi bio wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Wɔtoo dwom bi wieeɛ no, wofirii hɔ kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Pa A Petro Bɛpa No No Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Wɔduruu deɛ wɔrekɔ no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa bɛdwane agya me. Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn nam adiyifoɔ no so kaa sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛbɔ odwanhwɛfoɔ no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">na nnwan no abɔ apete.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Na sɛ mewusɔre a, mɛdi mo anim akɔ Galilea akɔhyia mo wɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ nnipa nyinaa bɛdwane agya wo a, me deɛ, merennwane nnya wo da!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Petro, ansa na anadwo yi akokɔ bɛbɔn mprenu no, na woapa me mprɛnsa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Petro de anibereɛ kaa sɛ, “Merempa wo da! Sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ me ne wo wu mpo a, merempa wo da!” Saa ara na wɔn a aka no nyinaa nso kaeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Mpaeɛ Wɔ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no duruu baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ Getsemane no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Montena ha, na merekɔbɔ mpaeɛ aba.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Ɔfaa Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane kaa ne ho, na ne ho hyɛɛ aseɛ yeraa no, na ɔyɛɛ basaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Awerɛhoɔ ahyɛ me kra ma. Montena ha, na mo ne me nwɛn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra, kɔbutuu fam, bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, saa ahoyera no ntwa ne ho nkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Abba, Agya! Wotumi yɛ biribiara. Ma kuruwa yi ntwa me ho nkɔ. Nanso, deɛ wopɛ na ɛnyɛ hɔ, na ɛnyɛ deɛ mepɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Ɔsane baeɛ no, ɔbɛhunuu asuafoɔ baasa no sɛ wɔadeda. Ɔbisaa Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Simon, woada? Woantumi ne me anwɛn dɔnhwereɛ baako pɛ mpo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/><char style="wj">Monwɛn na mommɔ mpaeɛ na ɔsɔhwɛfoɔ no anni mo so. Honhom no pɛ deɛ, na honam no na ɛyɛ mmerɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Ɔsane kɔɔ bio kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ korɔ no ara. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Ɔsane baa wɔn nkyɛn bio bɛhunuu sɛ wɔadeda, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔabrɛbrɛ. Na wonhunu deɛ wɔnka nkyerɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Ɔsane baa ne mprɛnsa so no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ. <char style="wj">“Mogu so adeda a morehome? Ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ mode da no atwam. Wɔrebɛyi Onipa Ba no ahyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nsa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/><char style="wj">Monsɔre na yɛnkɔ! Monhwɛ, deɛ ɔreyi me ama no wɔ ha!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Ɔgu so rekasa no, Yuda a ɔyɛ nʼasuafoɔ no mu baako ne dɔm a asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin asoma wɔn ka ne ho a, wɔkurakura akofena ne mmaa baa hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Na Yuda aka akyerɛ wɔn dada sɛ, “Deɛ mɛbam no, ayɛ no atuu no, ɔno ne deɛ morehwehwɛ no no. Monkyere no, na monsɔ ne mu yie mfa no nkɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Ɛno enti, wɔduruu hɔ pɛ, ɔkɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔbam no kaa sɛ, “Me Wura.” Afei, ɔyɛɛ no atuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Ɛhɔ ara, na ɛdɔm a wɔne Yuda nam no sɔɔ Yesu mu kyeree no. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Wɔn a wɔka Yesu ho no mu baako twee ne akofena de twaa Ɔsɔfopanin no akoa bi aso ma ɛteeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Meyɛ owudifoɔ enti na mode akofena ne mmaa aba me so rebɛkye me anaa?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/><char style="wj">Adɛn na ɛberɛ a merekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ no, moankye me? Nanso, yeinom nyinaa aba sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a nkɔm a wɔhyɛɛ wɔ me ho no bɛba mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Asuafoɔ no nyinaa dwane gyaa no.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Aberanteɛ bi a ɔde ntomasini bi asi nʼasene dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Ɛdɔm a wɔbɛkyeree Yesu no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no, nanso ɔgyaa ne ntoma no maa wɔn, de ne ho saa ara dwanee.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Ɔsɔfopanin Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Wɔde Yesu kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanin no anim no, ankyɛre na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin bi bɛhyiaa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔde Yesu rekɔ no, Petro tee ne ho dii wɔn akyi, na ɔwiawiaa ne ho kɔhyɛɛ Ɔsɔfopanin no efie hɔ de ne ho kɔfraa asomfoɔ bi a na wɔreto ogya no mu.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin ne badwafoɔ no nyinaa hwehwɛɛ sɛ wɔbɛnya asɛm bi atia Yesu, na wɔagyina so abu no kumfɔ. Nanso, wɔannya bi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Nnipa pii bɛdii adansekurumu tiaa Yesu, nanso wɔn nsɛm a wɔkaeɛ no bɔɔ abira.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Afei, nnipa no bi kekaa nsɛm a ɛnnim too ne so sɛ, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Yɛtee sɛ ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Mɛbubu asɔredan a wɔde nsa na ɛsii no, na mede nnansa asi foforɔ a wɔamfa nsa ansi!’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Na yei mpo, wɔn adanseɛ no anhyia.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no sɔre gyinaa badwa no mfimfini bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Yei nso, wonni ho anoyie biara? Ɛdeɛn na wowɔ ka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Yesu ammua no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Afei, Ɔsɔfopanin no bisaa no bio sɛ, “Wone Agyenkwa no, Onyankopɔn Ba no anaa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene no, na mobɛhunu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn nifa, na ɔnam omununkum mu resane aba asase so.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Yei maa Ɔsɔfopanin no sunsuanee nʼatadeɛ mu kaa sɛ, “Adansefoɔ bɛn na wɔn ho hia yɛn bio? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Mo nyinaa ate abususɛm a ɔkaeɛ no. Ɛdeɛn na mowɔ ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wɔn nyinaa gye too mu sɛ, ɔsɛ owuo. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Na ebinom tee ntasuo guu ne so, na wɔkyekyeree nʼani, na wɔbobɔɔ no akuturuku bisaa no sɛ “Wose woyɛ odiyifoɔ, kyerɛ yɛn onipa ko a ɔbɔɔ wo!” Na asomfoɔ a wɔde no rekɔ no bobɔɔ no asotorɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Ɛberɛ a na Petro te adihɔ hɔ no, Ɔsɔfopanin no mmaawa no mu baako baa hɔ; <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>na ɔhunuu Petro sɛ ɔreto ogya no, ɔhwɛɛ no haa, ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo nso wo ne Nasareni Yesu no na ɛnam!”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Petro saneeɛ sɛ, “Mennim deɛ woreka yi ho hwee!” Na ɛhɔ ara na ɔfirii adi kɔtenaa nkyɛn baabi. Saa ɛberɛ no ara na akokɔ bɔnee.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Abaawa no sane hunuu no, na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a ɔne wɔn nam no sɛ, “Yei nso ka wɔn ho. Ɔyɛ Yesu asuafoɔ no mu baako!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Petro saneeɛ bio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ɛkyɛɛ kakra no, nnipa a wɔgyina ogya no ho no hyɛɛ aseɛ ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, “Woka wɔn ho, ɛfiri sɛ, woyɛ Galileani!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petro kasa na ɛdaa no adi sɛ ɔyɛ Galileani.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Petro hyɛɛ aseɛ kekaa ntam, dii nse sɛ, “Mennim saa onipa a moreka ne ho asɛm yi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Na ɛhɔ ara, akokɔ bɔnee deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu. Na Petro kaee Yesu asɛm a ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Akokɔ remmɔn mprenu na woapa me mprɛnsa”</char> no. Na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ suiɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpatutuutu no, asɔfoɔ mpanin, Yudafoɔ mpanin, Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne agyinatufoɔ hyia dwenee ɛkwan a wɔde Yesu bɛfa so ho. Wɔkyekyeree no de no kɔhyɛɛ Pilato nsa.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Wɔde no duruu hɔ no, Pilato bisaa no sɛ, “Wone Yudafoɔ ɔhene no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo na moseɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Ɛhɔ ara, asɔfoɔ mpanin no kaa nsɛm akɛseakɛseɛ guu ne so, nanso wanka hwee. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilato bisaa no bio sɛ, “Enti, nsɛm akɛseakɛseɛ a wɔreka gu wo so yi, wonka ho hwee?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Nanso, Yesu anka hwee ma ɛyɛɛ Pilato nwanwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Na ɛyɛ Pilato amanneɛ sɛ, afe biara Twam Afahyɛ no mu, ɔgyaa odeduani baako a ɔman no pɛ sɛ wɔgyaa no ma wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Saa afe no mu, na onipa bi a wɔfrɛ no Baraba no ka nnipa bi a wɔsɔre tiaa aban, nam so dii awu no ho wɔ afiase hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Ɛdɔm no kɔɔ Pilato so kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ɔnyi odeduani baako mma wɔn sɛdeɛ daa ɔyɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilato bisaa sɛ, “Menyi ‘Yudafoɔ Ɔhene’ no mma mo anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, na wahunu sɛ asɔfoɔ mpanin no de ɔtan na atwa asɛm ato Yesu so ɛsiane din a na wagye no enti. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Nanso, asɔfoɔ mpanin no tuu dɔm no aso sɛ, sɛ wɔde bɛyi Yesu deɛ, wɔmpere ma wɔnyi Baraba.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Enti, Pilato bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Na sɛ meyi Baraba ma mo a, ɛdeɛn na menyɛ saa ɔbarima yi a mofrɛ no mo ɔhene no?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Wɔteateaam sɛ, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn bio sɛ, “Adɛn nti? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Wɔn nyinaa bɔ gyee so sɛ, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Afei, Pilato hunuu sɛ ɔyɛ asɛm no hwee a, ɛrenyɛ yie. Afei, na ɔsuro nso sɛ, sɛ anhwɛ a basabasayɛ bɛba enti, ɔgyaa Baraba maa wɔn. Ɔmaa wɔbɔɔ Yesu mmaa, na ɛno akyi no, ɔde no maa wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Fɛdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Asraafoɔ no de Yesu kɔɔ amrado aban mu hɔ, ɛnna wɔfrɛɛ asraafoɔ no nyinaa baa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Wɔhyɛɛ no batakari kɔkɔɔ bi, de nkasɛɛ atentene bi nwonoo ɛkyɛ hyɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ bɔ gyee so, dii ne ho fɛ sɛ, “Yudafoɔ ɔhene, wo nkwa so!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Wɔde abaa paa nʼapampam, tetee ntasuo guu ne so, buu no nkotodwe, de dii ne ho fɛw. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Wɔdii ne ho fɛ wieeɛ no, wɔworɔɔ batakari kɔkɔɔ no, ɛnna wɔde ɔno ara nʼatadeɛ hyɛɛ no, de no kɔeɛ sɛ wɔrekɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Asɛnnua Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wɔhyiaa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ɔfiri Kirene a ɔyɛ Aleksandro ne Rufo agya wɔ ɛkwan so. Wɔhyɛɛ no ma ɔsoaa Yesu asɛnnua no. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Wɔde Yesu baa baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ sɛ Golgota a (nʼasekyerɛ ne Nitire so) hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔmaa no nsã nwononwono bi sɛ ɔnnom, nanso wannom. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Afei, wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu. Yei akyi, wɔbɔɔ nʼatadeɛ no so ntonto.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Ɛbɛyɛ anɔpa nnɔnkron na wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Asɛm bi a wɔka too no so na wɔtwerɛɛ taree nʼasɛnnua no atifi ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">Yudafoɔ Ɔhene.<verse eid="MRK 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Ɛda no ara anɔpa, wɔbɔɔ awudifoɔ baanu bi asɛnnua mu kaa Yesu ho. Na ɔbaako sɛn ne nifa so, ɛnna ɔbaako nso sɛn ne benkum so. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Yei maa deɛ Atwerɛsɛm no kaa sɛ, “Wɔkan no fraa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ mu” no baa mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Nnipa a wɔsen faa hɔ no nyinaa wosowosoo wɔn ti, dii ne ho fɛ sɛ, “Ei, wo ni? Ɛnyɛ wo na woseɛ sɛ, wobɛtumi abubu asɔredan na wode nnansa asi no? <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Sɛ wose wo ho yɛ nwanwa a, ɛnneɛ siane firi asɛnnua no so si fam.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no nso atwa ahyia hɔ redi Yesu ho fɛw. Wɔkɔɔ so dii ne ho fɛ sɛ, “Ɔgye afoforɔ nanso ɔntumi nnye ne ho!” <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Wɔkɔɔ so dii ne ho fɛ bio sɛ, “Agyenkwa! Yudafoɔ ɔhene! Siane firi asɛnnua no so si fam, na yɛnnye wo nni!” Awudifoɔ a wɔbɔɔ wɔne Yesu asɛnnua mu no mpo dii ne ho fɛ bi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wuiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Ɛfiri owigyinaeɛ kɔpem nnɔnmiɛnsa no, esum duruu asase no so nyinaa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Yesu de nne kɛseɛ teaam sɛ, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?”</char></char> Ase ne sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me Onyankopɔn, Me Onyankopɔn, adɛn enti na woagya me?”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Wɔn a wɔgyina hɔ no bi a wɔtee deɛ ɔkaeɛ no kaa sɛ, “Montie sɛ ɔrefrɛ Elia.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Wɔn mu baako tuu mmirika, kɔfaa sapɔ bi, de bɔɔ nsã nwononwono bi mu, de tuaa dua bi ano, de brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnnom. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Momma yɛnhwɛ sɛ Elia bɛba abɛyi no asi fam anaa!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Afei, Yesu de nne kɛseɛ teaam bio, na ɔgyaa ne honhom mu wuiɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Ɛhɔ ara, ntoma a ɛtwa asɔredan no mu no mu suanee mmienu firi soro kɔsii fam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ntwamutam no tware Kronkron Beaeɛ ne Kronkron Mu Kronkron no mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-35">2 Mose 26.31-35</ref></char>). Ntwamutam no mu te a ɛteeɛ no kyerɛ sɛ Kristo kɔ ɔsoro ma yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma yɛn nso yɛapue Onyankopɔn anim.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Asraafoɔ ɔha so panin a na ɔgyina hɔ no hunuu ɛkwan a Yesu faa so wuiɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, “Ampa ara, onipa yi yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na mmaa bi gyinagyina akyiri baabi rehwɛ deɛ ɛrekɔ so. Mmaa no bi ne Maria Magdalene, Maria a ɔyɛ Yakobo kumaa ne Yosef maame ne Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Ɛberɛ a na Yesu wɔ Galilea no, saa mmaa yi dii nʼakyi somm no. Saa ara nso na na nnipa bi a wɔdii nʼakyi baa Yerusalem no bi nso wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, ɛsiane sɛ na adeɛ kye a ɛyɛ Homeda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ɛyɛ Efiada anwummerɛ.</char></note> no enti, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>ɔbadwani animuonyamfoɔ bi a, wɔfrɛ no Yosef a ɔfiri Arimatea a, na ɔretwɛn ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn Ahennie no bɛba no de akokoɔduru kɔɔ Pilato hɔ kɔsrɛɛ no sɛ, ɔmfa Yesu amu no mma no. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Ɛberɛ a Pilato tee sɛ Yesu awu no, wannye anni, enti ɔfrɛɛ Roma asraafoɔ panin a na ɔhwɛ hɔ no bisaa no. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Asraafoɔ panin no kaa sɛ wawu no, Pilato maa Yosef ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔnkɔfa amu no. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yosef kɔtɔɔ nwera, yii Yesu amu no firii asɛnnua no so, de nwera no kyekyeree no, ɔde no kɔtoo ɔboda bi a wɔatwa mu, piree ɛboɔ kɛseɛ bi hinii ano. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Na Maria Magdalene ne Yosef ne maame Maria wɔ hɔ bi, na wɔhunuu faako a wɔde Yesu amu no toeɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Owusɔreɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a Homeda no twaam no, Maria Magdalene ne Salome ne Yakobo maame Maria kɔtɔɔ nnuhwam sɛ wɔde rekɔ akɔsra Yesu amu no. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Ɛda a ɛdi nnawɔtwe no ɛkan anɔpahema no, ansa na owia bɛpue no, wɔde nnuhwam no baa ɛda no so. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Wɔnam ɛkwan so rekɔ no, na wɔredwene deɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛpire ɛboɔ no afiri ɛda no ano no ho.<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Nanso, wɔreyɛ aduru hɔ no, wɔmaa wɔn ani so hunuu sɛ, obi apire ɛboɔ kokuroko no afiri ɛda no ano. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Wɔkɔɔ ɛda no mu kɔhunuu aberanteɛ bi sɛ ɔhyɛ atadeɛ fitaa te nifa so hɔ. Wɔhunuu no no, wɔbɔɔ birim.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Nanso, aberanteɛ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnsuro. Ɛnyɛ Nasareni Yesu a wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu no na morehwehwɛ no no? Ɔnni ha! Wasɔre! Monhwɛ faako a wɔde no toeɛ hɔ! <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Afei, monkɔ na monkɔka yei nkyerɛ nʼasuafoɔ no ne Petro sɛ, ‘Yesu redi mo anim akɔ Galilea. Ɛhɔ na mobɛhunu no, sɛdeɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ mo ansa na ɔrewu no!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Mmaa no de ehu ne ahopopoɔ dwane firii hɔ a, na obiara ntumi ne ne yɔnko nkasa.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Maria Magdalene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Kwasiada anɔpa na Yesu sɔre firii awufoɔ mu. Onipa a ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no kane ne Maria Magdalene, ɔbaa a ɔtuu ahonhommɔne nson firii ne mu no. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Maria Magdalene kɔɔ asuafoɔ no nkyɛn kɔhunuu wɔn sɛ wɔn werɛ ahoɔ, na wɔresu. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, wahunu Yesu na ɔte ase. Nanso, wɔannye no anni.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Asuafoɔ Baanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Akyire yi, Yesu yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn mu baanu a wɔnam firi Yerusalem rekɔ akuraa, nanso wɔhunuu no no, ahyɛaseɛ no, wɔantumi anhunu sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno, ɛfiri sɛ, na wasesa. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Akyire no a wɔhunuu onipa ko a ɔyɛ no, wɔtuu mmirika sane baa Yerusalem, bɛka kyerɛɛ nkaeɛ no, nanso obiara annye wɔn anni.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Akyire no a asuafoɔ dubaako no te adidiiɛ no, ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn. Ɔkaa wɔn anim wɔ gyidie a wɔnni ne gye a wɔannye wɔn a wɔbɛkaa sɛ wasɔre no anni no ho.<verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomafoɔ No Asɛmpaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ ewiase nyinaa nkɔka asɛmpa no nkyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔgye di na wɔbɔ no asu no, wɔbɛgye no nkwa. Na obiara a ɔnnye nni no, wɔbɛbu no fɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/><char style="wj">Saa nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ yi bɛdi wɔn a wɔgye me di no akyi. Wɔde me din bɛtu ahonhommɔne, na wɔaka kasa foforɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛsɔ awɔ mu, na sɛ wɔnom awuduro bi mpo a, ɛrenyɛ wɔn hwee; wɔde wɔn nsa bɛgu ayarefoɔ so, ama wɔn ho ayɛ wɔn den.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sorokɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Awurade Yesu ne wɔn kasa wieeɛ akyi no, wɔfaa no kɔɔ ɔsoro na ɔkɔtenaa Onyankopɔn nsa nifa so. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Yei akyi no, asuafoɔ no kɔkaa asɛm no wɔ baabiara, na Awurade kaa wɔn ho ma wɔyɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ nso, de hyɛɛ wɔn nsɛm a wɔkaeɛ no mu den.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
